(2366811, 327721, 15711, '<td valign="top">AWESOME! Love everything about this. The open mouth and eyes,  the arm about to come up and over as she turns her head to breath. The stop action and focus is spot on! I love the blue lane divider behind her too - 10 - best I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'AWESOME! Love everything about this. The open mouth and eyes,  the arm about to come up and over as she turns her head to breath. The stop action and focus is spot on! I love the blue lane divider behind her too - 10 - best I''ve seen so far.', '2006-05-01 02:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2366816, 328317, 44086, '<td valign="top">Great Scene! I like the way you framed left. Gives a cool feeling of off balance. 9</td>', 'Great Scene! I like the way you framed left. Gives a cool feeling of off balance. 9', '2006-05-01 02:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2366820, 327481, 44086, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. Seems like your eye leads to the cameraman and guy in black but they seem soft focused. Also, sky highlights seem blown out. 4</td>', 'Interesting photo. Seems like your eye leads to the cameraman and guy in black but they seem soft focused. Also, sky highlights seem blown out. 4', '2006-05-01 02:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2366831, 326782, 44086, '<td valign="top">I know it''s hard to catch a fastball in the air, but sports photos just look better with a ball somewhere. Also, you could use the dodge tool on the players faces and dark jerseys to bring up the detail a little.</td>', 'I know it''s hard to catch a fastball in the air, but sports photos just look better with a ball somewhere. Also, you could use the dodge tool on the players faces and dark jerseys to bring up the detail a little.', '2006-05-01 02:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2366839, 328471, 44086, '<td valign="top">Really interesting perspective. However, since the entertainer is the subject he needs to be in sharper focus. Also a different angle would have captured the same effect without the distracting shadow on the wall.</td>', 'Really interesting perspective. However, since the entertainer is the subject he needs to be in sharper focus. Also a different angle would have captured the same effect without the distracting shadow on the wall.', '2006-05-01 02:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2366845, 327909, 44086, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo. I think I would like it more in color or maybe selective desaturation. 7</td>', 'I really like this photo. I think I would like it more in color or maybe selective desaturation. 7', '2006-05-01 02:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2366850, 327763, 44086, '<td valign="top">Nice cropping. IMHO it could use a little more saturation and perhaps a shadow dodge on the face of the performer.</td>', 'Nice cropping. IMHO it could use a little more saturation and perhaps a shadow dodge on the face of the performer.', '2006-05-01 02:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2366852, 327856, 40912, '<td valign="top">Is there actually a tornado behind him?</td>', 'Is there actually a tornado behind him?', '2006-05-01 02:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2366894, 327935, 44086, '<td valign="top">Great shot. If I could change one thing I might lighten the sky. It''s a stark contrast but a bit unreal looking. 9</td>', 'Great shot. If I could change one thing I might lighten the sky. It''s a stark contrast but a bit unreal looking. 9', '2006-05-01 02:39:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2366901, 326844, 44086, '<td valign="top">Looks like you need to square your image. Also, might benefit from increasing saturation? 5</td>', 'Looks like you need to square your image. Also, might benefit from increasing saturation? 5', '2006-05-01 02:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2366905, 327489, 44086, '<td valign="top">Great. Nice catch on the exuberation. 9</td>', 'Great. Nice catch on the exuberation. 9', '2006-05-01 02:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
