(2366934, 327989, 50674, '<td valign="top">Great catch. I "met" the Danish Queen while the Candid challenge was on the other day. But the camera was in the bag, the card full and by the time I had deleted a photo, all I saw was her back.<br/>I like this one, a typical shot for a newspaper/magazine IMO.</td>', 'Great catch. I "met" the Danish Queen while the Candid challenge was on the other day. But the camera was in the bag, the card full and by the time I had deleted a photo, all I saw was her back.I like this one, a typical shot for a newspaper/magazine IMO.', '2006-05-01 02:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2366936, 328139, 10170, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning, love it.  However, I see this as a portrait rather than photo journalism, so loses a little as DNMC.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning, love it.  However, I see this as a portrait rather than photo journalism, so loses a little as DNMC.', '2006-05-01 02:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
