(2367204, 328544, 15810, '<td valign="top">There is something unappealing about your composition. Perhaps it''s because both people are near the edges of the frame with a large portion of your photograph as dead space or perhaps it''s because I can''t really see either of their faces and so can''t make a "connection" with either, perhaps it''s a little bit of both and with the tilted verticals too, it just doesn''t work.  Sorry.</td>', 'There is something unappealing about your composition. Perhaps it''s because both people are near the edges of the frame with a large portion of your photograph as dead space or perhaps it''s because I can''t really see either of their faces and so can''t make a "connection" with either, perhaps it''s a little bit of both and with the tilted verticals too, it just doesn''t work.  Sorry.', '2006-05-01 04:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2367246, 328282, 56752, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, and I know you were going for the ''newspaper'' look, but the sheer amount of empty space in this picture isn''t really what you''d find on a frontpage newspaper picture</td>', 'This is a good idea, and I know you were going for the ''newspaper'' look, but the sheer amount of empty space in this picture isn''t really what you''d find on a frontpage newspaper picture', '2006-05-01 05:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
