(2368529, 326209, 52908, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this shot. The focus is a slightly off. This shot is a little weak for an ''above the fold'' newspaper front page</td>', 'I like the concept of this shot. The focus is a slightly off. This shot is a little weak for an ''above the fold'' newspaper front page', '2006-05-01 13:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368532, 327247, 52908, '<td valign="top">This is one of the better shots i''ve seen so far in this challenge. You caught both eyes, background supports the foreground. The image is a little too centered though. The rule of 3rds could have been applied to make this a better image. 5 from me</td>', 'This is one of the better shots i''ve seen so far in this challenge. You caught both eyes, background supports the foreground. The image is a little too centered though. The rule of 3rds could have been applied to make this a better image. 5 from me', '2006-05-01 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368537, 328131, 52908, '<td valign="top">I could see this shot big on the second or third page. But it probably wouldn''t make it past the editor for an ''above the fold'' image.</td>', 'I could see this shot big on the second or third page. But it probably wouldn''t make it past the editor for an ''above the fold'' image.', '2006-05-01 13:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368539, 328333, 52908, '<td valign="top">Great shot! The lense distortion towards the bottom is a bit distracting. 7 from me.</td>', 'Great shot! The lense distortion towards the bottom is a bit distracting. 7 from me.', '2006-05-01 13:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368542, 327790, 52908, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot, it''s really close to being a great shot. With sports, it''s critical that you have the ball in the photo. Baseball players don''t jump or slide into a base for no reason. The ball is the reason. 6 from me.</td>', 'This is a good shot, it''s really close to being a great shot. With sports, it''s critical that you have the ball in the photo. Baseball players don''t jump or slide into a base for no reason. The ball is the reason. 6 from me.', '2006-05-01 13:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368546, 326901, 22538, '<td valign="top">Hi. It''s 4 from me as without the caption I would have failed to get the context.</td>', 'Hi. It''s 4 from me as without the caption I would have failed to get the context.', '2006-05-01 13:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368551, 328262, 56047, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot - the spray of the water makes for a good background, and the boat is well frozen. The grey day takes away a little from the excitement of the shot, and the foreground weeds are a little distracting, but overall a nice shot...</td>', 'Nice action shot - the spray of the water makes for a good background, and the boat is well frozen. The grey day takes away a little from the excitement of the shot, and the foreground weeds are a little distracting, but overall a nice shot...', '2006-05-01 13:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368552, 328407, 52908, '<td valign="top">Wow. The epitome of "f/8 and be there". Too a bad the officers faces are covered. Just the heavyness of this photo makes it possible that it could be on the front page of small town newspaper.</td>', 'Wow. The epitome of "f/8 and be there". Too a bad the officers faces are covered. Just the heavyness of this photo makes it possible that it could be on the front page of small town newspaper.', '2006-05-01 13:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368555, 328276, 52908, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. hope people still take the gas covered $20''s.</td>', 'Nice shot. hope people still take the gas covered $20''s.', '2006-05-01 13:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368557, 326086, 22538, '<td valign="top">NIce idea but looks a bit dull. Did you try it in colour with a bit of red seeping into the picture from somewhere, for example?</td>', 'NIce idea but looks a bit dull. Did you try it in colour with a bit of red seeping into the picture from somewhere, for example?', '2006-05-01 13:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368558, 327998, 56047, '<td valign="top">Nice, sharp photo, good colors. I personally think I would like the see the entire bike within the frame, although that may just be a personal thing, since the close crop seems to work well here.</td>', 'Nice, sharp photo, good colors. I personally think I would like the see the entire bike within the frame, although that may just be a personal thing, since the close crop seems to work well here.', '2006-05-01 13:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368568, 326871, 54602, '<td valign="top">LOL! That is too cute. Ok, kudos for the big smile. :oD</td>', 'LOL! That is too cute. Ok, kudos for the big smile. :oD', '2006-05-01 13:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368575, 327963, 50441, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image.  Great tones too.</td>', 'Very powerful image.  Great tones too.', '2006-05-01 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368577, 327501, 50441, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2006-05-01 13:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368578, 328354, 54602, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2006-05-01 13:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368582, 328016, 56047, '<td valign="top">Technically, the image is not very crips and clean - looks almost like a low resolution shot. However, you caught a great expression on his face, and for me, the emotions really come through in this photo, which I think its the most important thing.</td>', 'Technically, the image is not very crips and clean - looks almost like a low resolution shot. However, you caught a great expression on his face, and for me, the emotions really come through in this photo, which I think its the most important thing.', '2006-05-01 13:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368587, 327721, 54602, '<td valign="top">impressive. I like the exact focus, and her eye contact.</td>', 'impressive. I like the exact focus, and her eye contact.', '2006-05-01 13:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368591, 326676, 56047, '<td valign="top">Very well done, nicely laid out, and works very well with your title.</td>', 'Very well done, nicely laid out, and works very well with your title.', '2006-05-01 13:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368601, 328513, 56047, '<td valign="top">Well seen, very colorful, and I like the crop.</td>', 'Well seen, very colorful, and I like the crop.', '2006-05-01 13:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368608, 327445, 56047, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, and I like how he is silhouetted against the blue sky.</td>', 'Great perspective, and I like how he is silhouetted against the blue sky.', '2006-05-01 13:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368663, 327640, 22538, '<td valign="top">Or "Colour reels of Hitchcock''s masterpiece North by Northwest discovered"?</td>', 'Or "Colour reels of Hitchcock''s masterpiece North by Northwest discovered"?', '2006-05-01 14:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368685, 327529, 5885, '<td valign="top">OK, this works for me. I''d like to see a little more of "the spirit" but static shots like this often do make newspapers.</td>', 'OK, this works for me. I''d like to see a little more of "the spirit" but static shots like this often do make newspapers.', '2006-05-01 14:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368687, 327729, 22538, '<td valign="top">I hope it could be relieved of the suffering?</td>', 'I hope it could be relieved of the suffering?', '2006-05-01 14:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368690, 328513, 5885, '<td valign="top">This is a neat lifestyles section type photo. I like that you''ve included a human in the photo and not just a static photo of the van.</td>', 'This is a neat lifestyles section type photo. I like that you''ve included a human in the photo and not just a static photo of the van.', '2006-05-01 14:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368698, 328016, 5885, '<td valign="top">The post process is a bit too artsy and dark for newspapers, but the image works well for a human interest story.</td>', 'The post process is a bit too artsy and dark for newspapers, but the image works well for a human interest story.', '2006-05-01 14:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368700, 328213, 5885, '<td valign="top">The title would work better with a photo of a traffic jam or busy highway. What I see here is just a static picture of the front genders of a car. Not really newsworthy to me.</td>', 'The title would work better with a photo of a traffic jam or busy highway. What I see here is just a static picture of the front genders of a car. Not really newsworthy to me.', '2006-05-01 14:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368736, 328113, 44086, '<td valign="top">Nice clean shot. Like the heavy contrast. Tell that kid to smile:-)  7</td>', 'Nice clean shot. Like the heavy contrast. Tell that kid to smile:-)  7', '2006-05-01 14:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368741, 327996, 44086, '<td valign="top">Main subject seriously out-of-focus and in need of saturation. Plus side is the ball is in the picture. 4</td>', 'Main subject seriously out-of-focus and in need of saturation. Plus side is the ball is in the picture. 4', '2006-05-01 14:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368743, 326782, 18219, '<td valign="top">it seems alittle dark overall.<br/>but you''ve captured the action nicely.</td>', 'it seems alittle dark overall.but you''ve captured the action nicely.', '2006-05-01 14:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368745, 327770, 5885, '<td valign="top">You really got out there and got political news... good job. :-)</td>', 'You really got out there and got political news... good job. :-)', '2006-05-01 14:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2368748, 327885, 44086, '<td valign="top">I get the emphasis on the veteran but it looks like he''s a bit overlit. Fill flash might have worked better here. 5</td>', 'I get the emphasis on the veteran but it looks like he''s a bit overlit. Fill flash might have worked better here. 5', '2006-05-01 14:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
