(2368781, 328518, 5885, '<td valign="top">I so wanted to go to the Jazz Fest, just had too many other things to do. :-( Great photo for an A&amp;E section of a newspaper or Entertainment magazine.</td>', 'I so wanted to go to the Jazz Fest, just had too many other things to do. :-( Great photo for an A&E section of a newspaper or Entertainment magazine.', '2006-05-01 15:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
