(2370286, 327790, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I''m no photojournalist but I am a big baseball fan. :) I like this one. The only negative I have is the fact that you can see the scoreboard, which normally would be a good thing but the fact that it tells me the game just started indicates that maybe this wasn''t the most critical play even if it was. Maybe title it better. For example, if the home team won say so or if they kept it close say that. Or better yet you could have submitted something that occurred later in the game so that the scoreboard in the background could tell the story instead of the title. Anyway, just my opinion. Good luck!</td>', 'Nice capture. I''m no photojournalist but I am a big baseball fan. :) I like this one. The only negative I have is the fact that you can see the scoreboard, which normally would be a good thing but the fact that it tells me the game just started indicates that maybe this wasn''t the most critical play even if it was. Maybe title it better. For example, if the home team won say so or if they kept it close say that. Or better yet you could have submitted something that occurred later in the game so that the scoreboard in the background could tell the story instead of the title. Anyway, just my opinion. Good luck!', '2006-05-01 22:25:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2370290, 327964, 55642, '<td valign="top">Focus on both the kitten and the senior citizen... this is too much of a pet photo with too little human interest.</td>', 'Focus on both the kitten and the senior citizen... this is too much of a pet photo with too little human interest.', '2006-05-01 22:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
