(2370300, 328518, 18219, '<td valign="top">I''ve met him!<br/>Twice!<br/>No, really, I have.<br/>Ask me about it when the challenge is over.<br/>I''d certainly like to see what other shots you have of him.<br/>Actually, my girlfriend would like to see them.<br/> <br/>Anyway, back to the photo!!!!<br/>I''m sure a lot of people won''t appreciate how fortunate you were to get this shot, there can''t be many places where you can take such a clear picture of such a big celeberity.<br/>The DOF is good.<br/>I think his face is just a little lacking in focus.<br/>But his sweat and expression show how much the music means to him.</td>', 'I''ve met him!Twice!No, really, I have.Ask me about it when the challenge is over.I''d certainly like to see what other shots you have of him.Actually, my girlfriend would like to see them. Anyway, back to the photo!!!!I''m sure a lot of people won''t appreciate how fortunate you were to get this shot, there can''t be many places where you can take such a clear picture of such a big celeberity.The DOF is good.I think his face is just a little lacking in focus.But his sweat and expression show how much the music means to him.', '2006-05-01 22:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2370301, 328276, 55642, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but too snapshot-y. This would be great in a studio environment with professional lighting and a super-crisp focus throughout.</td>', 'Nice idea, but too snapshot-y. This would be great in a studio environment with professional lighting and a super-crisp focus throughout.', '2006-05-01 22:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
