(2370776, 328518, 58251, '<td valign="top">So he''s singing?  There''s nothing here that screams "action!!!".  It''s just a sweaty man singing.  Might be better with different lighting and background.</td>', 'So he''s singing?  There''s nothing here that screams "action!!!".  It''s just a sweaty man singing.  Might be better with different lighting and background.', '2006-05-02 01:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
