(2370868, 327697, 51125, '<td valign="top">Cute girl and strong sense of being part of the action.  Playing with the curves may give you better skin tone.</td>', 'Cute girl and strong sense of being part of the action.  Playing with the curves may give you better skin tone.', '2006-05-02 02:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
