(2372322, 326873, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh this is awesome!  I love those blue lights, and there is amazing sharpness for such a low light situation.  Excellent job.</td>', 'Oh this is awesome!  I love those blue lights, and there is amazing sharpness for such a low light situation.  Excellent job.', '2006-05-02 13:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2372330, 328458, 24454, '<td valign="top">VERY COOL!!!!!  I love all the motion and light.   and I''m totally impressed that you got such amazing sharpness on your subject in such a low light situation!  Great job!</td>', 'VERY COOL!!!!!  I love all the motion and light.   and I''m totally impressed that you got such amazing sharpness on your subject in such a low light situation!  Great job!', '2006-05-02 13:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2372334, 328150, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is awesome!  Very emotive.  Executed perfectly.   Definitely ought to be on the cover of a magazine!  10</td>', 'This is awesome!  Very emotive.  Executed perfectly.   Definitely ought to be on the cover of a magazine!  10', '2006-05-02 13:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2372345, 328518, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh you lucky!!!!!   I''d love to see Dave Matthews in person!  And WOW!!!  What an amazing. . .razor sharp capture!!!!   Ok. . .I''ll try not to mark you down for the jealousy factor :)  (just kidding).  To me, this is flawless.  Perfect photojournalism!  10</td>', 'Oh you lucky!!!!!   I''d love to see Dave Matthews in person!  And WOW!!!  What an amazing. . .razor sharp capture!!!!   Ok. . .I''ll try not to mark you down for the jealousy factor :)  (just kidding).  To me, this is flawless.  Perfect photojournalism!  10', '2006-05-02 13:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2372355, 328051, 51793, '<td valign="top">The fact that you had everyone looking at you is amazing. Good shot</td>', 'The fact that you had everyone looking at you is amazing. Good shot', '2006-05-02 13:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2372374, 328293, 24454, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!!!!!   What an AMAZING capture!!!!   I love the star in it to add that "dazzling" effect!   This could not be a more perfect magazine cover for this kind of event!  10</td>', 'WOW!!!!!!!   What an AMAZING capture!!!!   I love the star in it to add that "dazzling" effect!   This could not be a more perfect magazine cover for this kind of event!  10', '2006-05-02 13:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2372377, 328190, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Talk about fire in the sky!  This is stunning!   I love the mountain to give this even more of a dramatic backdrop!   Outstanding!</td>', 'Wow!  Talk about fire in the sky!  This is stunning!   I love the mountain to give this even more of a dramatic backdrop!   Outstanding!', '2006-05-02 13:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2372611, 328292, 58163, '<td valign="top">i think this image works for showing a freaky looking guy, but as far as photojournalism goes, it looks a bit too posed.  setting up shots (unless for specific environmental portrait shots of an individual) are generally not accepted in photojournalism.</td>', 'i think this image works for showing a freaky looking guy, but as far as photojournalism goes, it looks a bit too posed.  setting up shots (unless for specific environmental portrait shots of an individual) are generally not accepted in photojournalism.', '2006-05-02 15:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
