(2372756, 328317, 54399, '<td valign="top">A very interesting shot, well composed</td>', 'A very interesting shot, well composed', '2006-05-02 16:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2372942, 328471, 7889, '<td valign="top">When I saw this It just hit me as a wonderful photo. I love the shadow/position of the entertainer and this works well in b&amp;W. Best of luck</td>', 'When I saw this It just hit me as a wonderful photo. I love the shadow/position of the entertainer and this works well in b&W. Best of luck', '2006-05-02 17:13:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2372962, 328317, 7889, '<td valign="top">The background is a bit of a mess and could spoil this but I dont think so as the eyes are drawn totaly to the two main characters. It looks staged but it also looks natural, its easy on the eye yet puts across a powerful message. Good luck</td>', 'The background is a bit of a mess and could spoil this but I dont think so as the eyes are drawn totaly to the two main characters. It looks staged but it also looks natural, its easy on the eye yet puts across a powerful message. Good luck', '2006-05-02 17:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2372966, 326676, 7889, '<td valign="top">I am not a big fan of national flags but I know when I see a good photograph and this is a good photograph, could even be a great photograph. It is what I would expect to find in a magazine like Time. I wish you luck</td>', 'I am not a big fan of national flags but I know when I see a good photograph and this is a good photograph, could even be a great photograph. It is what I would expect to find in a magazine like Time. I wish you luck', '2006-05-02 17:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2372968, 326782, 36006, '<td valign="top">This is a good effort. However, the highlights are too blown. The blacks are too black. In a good b&amp;w you need texture within your highlights and shadows.<br/> <br/>In sports, this is a nice attempt. Some things to remember when shooting sports is the following, have action, get facial expressions, crop tight if possible, don''t cut off limbs if possible, don''t have lines going through players in the bg, don''t have advertisement, make sure the pix is tack sharp, and finally (in this picture) have the ball in frame.</td>', 'This is a good effort. However, the highlights are too blown. The blacks are too black. In a good b&w you need texture within your highlights and shadows. In sports, this is a nice attempt. Some things to remember when shooting sports is the following, have action, get facial expressions, crop tight if possible, don''t cut off limbs if possible, don''t have lines going through players in the bg, don''t have advertisement, make sure the pix is tack sharp, and finally (in this picture) have the ball in frame.', '2006-05-02 17:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2372976, 326658, 7889, '<td valign="top">Yeh, I can see this in a magazine or newspaper article. Technically its just about right, b&amp;w is a good choice, seems to give the picture strength and anyway I prefer b&amp;w. Best of luck</td>', 'Yeh, I can see this in a magazine or newspaper article. Technically its just about right, b&w is a good choice, seems to give the picture strength and anyway I prefer b&w. Best of luck', '2006-05-02 17:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2372978, 327963, 36006, '<td valign="top">This is a great b&amp;w.The highlights are just a bit blown, and the blacks could use a tweeking, but overall nice levels.<br/> <br/> The thing is, it has no emotional value. The face of the begger would of done this, however, he is turned away from the camera. If I had seen his face, than the story would of been complete, as it is, I don''t feel anything.</td>', 'This is a great b&w.The highlights are just a bit blown, and the blacks could use a tweeking, but overall nice levels.  The thing is, it has no emotional value. The face of the begger would of done this, however, he is turned away from the camera. If I had seen his face, than the story would of been complete, as it is, I don''t feel anything.', '2006-05-02 17:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2372985, 328218, 7889, '<td valign="top">Execellent capture! Timing is spot on, Its perfect for this challenge, nothing I would change. Hope you do well</td>', 'Execellent capture! Timing is spot on, Its perfect for this challenge, nothing I would change. Hope you do well', '2006-05-02 17:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2372988, 328409, 36006, '<td valign="top">This could of been a great b&amp;w. But, the whites are too blown the blacks are too black. A good b&amp;w needs texture in the hightlights and shadows.<br/> <br/>The picture itself is good. I get emotional value from the ump. If however I did not see any facial expressions, then the emotional value would be lost.</td>', 'This could of been a great b&w. But, the whites are too blown the blacks are too black. A good b&w needs texture in the hightlights and shadows. The picture itself is good. I get emotional value from the ump. If however I did not see any facial expressions, then the emotional value would be lost.', '2006-05-02 17:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
