(2374606, 327909, 56735, '<td valign="top">At first glance, this pic is no different from a Cartier Bresson photograph. However, I must tell u that u have been too lazy, composing this image-this one is incomplete, and perhaps, u should have croutched a bit more, had u wanted a better photo.<br/> <br/>THe best angle for this photo was-croutch lower and move to the left a bit, and get the photo from a lower angle.<br/> <br/>Best of luck my pal and must tell you-you have great talent in you, and must thank god for this special gift. Carry on photographing and open you eyes wider from now on!<br/> <br/>Best of luck,<br/> <br/>Shomee</td>', 'At first glance, this pic is no different from a Cartier Bresson photograph. However, I must tell u that u have been too lazy, composing this image-this one is incomplete, and perhaps, u should have croutched a bit more, had u wanted a better photo. THe best angle for this photo was-croutch lower and move to the left a bit, and get the photo from a lower angle. Best of luck my pal and must tell you-you have great talent in you, and must thank god for this special gift. Carry on photographing and open you eyes wider from now on! Best of luck, Shomee', '2006-05-03 00:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
