(2376953, 328274, 42495, '<td valign="top">This looks like''s it''s [i]already[/] in a newspaper, which I''m guessing was the effect you were going after.  I like the composition, but the kids in the background take away from the main subjects.</td>', 'This looks like''s it''s [i]already[/] in a newspaper, which I''m guessing was the effect you were going after.  I like the composition, but the kids in the background take away from the main subjects.', '2006-05-03 12:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2376965, 328317, 42495, '<td valign="top">Technically this is very good.  What really makes it work for me is that they do indeed look like they are from two different worlds.  How they''re sitting, their clothes, and even the tennis ball and umbrella make them seem sooooo different.</td>', 'Technically this is very good.  What really makes it work for me is that they do indeed look like they are from two different worlds.  How they''re sitting, their clothes, and even the tennis ball and umbrella make them seem sooooo different.', '2006-05-03 12:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2377033, 328407, 42495, '<td valign="top">I am commenting on the 1st 25 pictures I vote for (to give good, bad, and average a chance at comments) and yours came up.  I saw the thumbnail and was hoping and yet dreading this one.<br/> <br/>This picture makes me uncomfortable because of the subject obviously, but also from where it was shot.  Whether decision or because you had no choice, the "behind the trees" shot definately makes this seem like I''m looking at something I shouldn''t be.  But it''s hard not to look.<br/> <br/>I''d probably rotate it just a bit.  Well done.</td>', 'I am commenting on the 1st 25 pictures I vote for (to give good, bad, and average a chance at comments) and yours came up.  I saw the thumbnail and was hoping and yet dreading this one. This picture makes me uncomfortable because of the subject obviously, but also from where it was shot.  Whether decision or because you had no choice, the "behind the trees" shot definately makes this seem like I''m looking at something I shouldn''t be.  But it''s hard not to look. I''d probably rotate it just a bit.  Well done.', '2006-05-03 12:37:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2377042, 327815, 56965, '<td valign="top">I like the vibrant colors in this shot</td>', 'I like the vibrant colors in this shot', '2006-05-03 12:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2377045, 328455, 36499, '<td valign="top">not to be picky but the legs look weird to me, like they wernt there to begin with and pasted in...could be cause i cant see the rest of the girl at all. other than that i think this is a great photojournalism shot and very well executed. good luck<br/> <br/>~~Cher~~ :o)</td>', 'not to be picky but the legs look weird to me, like they wernt there to begin with and pasted in...could be cause i cant see the rest of the girl at all. other than that i think this is a great photojournalism shot and very well executed. good luck ~~Cher~~ :o)', '2006-05-03 12:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
