(2378812, 326474, 1054, '<td valign="top">Is this a real accident? I don''t see skid marks anywhere...</td>', 'Is this a real accident? I don''t see skid marks anywhere...', '2006-05-03 19:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2378849, 326676, 4411, '<td valign="top">I really don''t like the title. To my mind it should be a title and not an explanation.<br/> <br/>That out of the way ... this shot just oozes atmosphere. Dark and faded and grimey, with plenty to look at and ponder. No comment on the politics because this would fit that type of feature perfectly whether you agree with it or not. Top stuff.</td>', 'I really don''t like the title. To my mind it should be a title and not an explanation. That out of the way ... this shot just oozes atmosphere. Dark and faded and grimey, with plenty to look at and ponder. No comment on the politics because this would fit that type of feature perfectly whether you agree with it or not. Top stuff.', '2006-05-03 19:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2378872, 325938, 1054, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and perfect exposure.</td>', 'Excellent composition and perfect exposure.', '2006-05-03 19:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2378886, 327021, 1054, '<td valign="top">This image seems a bit more compressed than it needs to be, and has visible JPEG artifacts as a result. Check out the section on resizing and saving for web in this tutorial, it may help: //www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26</td>', 'This image seems a bit more compressed than it needs to be, and has visible JPEG artifacts as a result. Check out the section on resizing and saving for web in this tutorial, it may help: //www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=26', '2006-05-03 19:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
