(2379778, 328298, 36065, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I think this is one of the coolest entrances on all the aquariums I''ve been to.  This one may not fare well outside the Atlanta voters, but here it has been a media frenzy from day 1.  It absolutely fits the challenge.  I also like the exposure that you achieved here.  The guy in the left corner is nicely focused while the fish give the shot great motion.  It makes want to look through the frame and see what the fishies are running from.  Nicely seen and well captured.  By the way, you aquarium exposure is very nice.  This isn''t easy light to overcome.  I bet Leroy nailed you on the title.  Those pesky photojournalism majors.</td>', 'Very nice!  I think this is one of the coolest entrances on all the aquariums I''ve been to.  This one may not fare well outside the Atlanta voters, but here it has been a media frenzy from day 1.  It absolutely fits the challenge.  I also like the exposure that you achieved here.  The guy in the left corner is nicely focused while the fish give the shot great motion.  It makes want to look through the frame and see what the fishies are running from.  Nicely seen and well captured.  By the way, you aquarium exposure is very nice.  This isn''t easy light to overcome.  I bet Leroy nailed you on the title.  Those pesky photojournalism majors.', '2006-05-03 22:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2379820, 327998, 51802, '<td valign="top">This is cropped a little too close.  It would be better if entire bike was in the shot.</td>', 'This is cropped a little too close.  It would be better if entire bike was in the shot.', '2006-05-03 22:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
