(2383323, 327489, 39144, '<td valign="top">Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2<br/>Contrast/Color: 2/2<br/>Composition: 1/2<br/>Photo Quality: 1/2<br/>My Subjective Affinity: 0/2<br/>Total: 5/10<br/> <br/>This photo doesn''t really pop out to me in any way. It just seems more like a "snapshot" of a familiar face than something that would be worthy of a front page.</td>', 'Fit Challenge Criteria: 1/2Contrast/Color: 2/2Composition: 1/2Photo Quality: 1/2My Subjective Affinity: 0/2Total: 5/10 This photo doesn''t really pop out to me in any way. It just seems more like a "snapshot" of a familiar face than something that would be worthy of a front page.', '2006-05-04 21:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383407, 328051, 24642, '<td valign="top">Colorful and bright. Fits the challenge</td>', 'Colorful and bright. Fits the challenge', '2006-05-04 22:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383413, 328225, 24642, '<td valign="top">Fínt fréttaefni.</td>', 'Fínt fréttaefni.', '2006-05-04 22:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383475, 327935, 47704, '<td valign="top">This looks like a good idea but it looks processed to hell.  It has a fake look to it.</td>', 'This looks like a good idea but it looks processed to hell.  It has a fake look to it.', '2006-05-04 22:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383478, 328518, 47704, '<td valign="top">10....because I LOVE DMB!</td>', '10....because I LOVE DMB!', '2006-05-04 22:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383629, 328507, 51802, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit off.</td>', 'Focus is a bit off.', '2006-05-04 23:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383651, 326474, 42256, '<td valign="top">whew.... you saw that happening ?? hope people survived the crash !!</td>', 'whew.... you saw that happening ?? hope people survived the crash !!', '2006-05-04 23:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383658, 328459, 26464, '<td valign="top">awesome shot... but photojournalism works much better with a human subject.</td>', 'awesome shot... but photojournalism works much better with a human subject.', '2006-05-04 23:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383710, 328067, 1031, '<td valign="top">Yeah, maybe when they discover that''s the price per <i>liter!</i></td>', 'Yeah, maybe when they discover that''s the price per liter!', '2006-05-05 00:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383717, 328139, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice cover photo.</td>', 'Nice cover photo.', '2006-05-05 00:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383722, 325864, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the way the column of soldiers fades into black on the upper-right -- makes it seem like an endless procession morching out of nowhere.</td>', 'I like the way the column of soldiers fades into black on the upper-right -- makes it seem like an endless procession morching out of nowhere.', '2006-05-05 00:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383746, 327989, 57650, '<td valign="top">she loves it!</td>', 'she loves it!', '2006-05-05 00:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383754, 327049, 1031, '<td valign="top">The hospital a few blocks down the street has a landing pad for our version of these guys.</td>', 'The hospital a few blocks down the street has a landing pad for our version of these guys.', '2006-05-05 00:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383783, 327412, 53164, '<td valign="top">i think it would have been better ifn you were to capture them crossing the finish line.</td>', 'i think it would have been better ifn you were to capture them crossing the finish line.', '2006-05-05 00:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383784, 327721, 38496, '<td valign="top">great shot!  Love the ''frozen'' water, and I can almost feel her (him?) breathing.</td>', 'great shot!  Love the ''frozen'' water, and I can almost feel her (him?) breathing.', '2006-05-05 00:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383788, 328047, 38496, '<td valign="top">I had to look at the title to get this.  At first glance I thought it was just really out of focus or something.  Nice shot, but a bit more of the ''surroundings'' might make it more obvious that it''s a reflection.</td>', 'I had to look at the title to get this.  At first glance I thought it was just really out of focus or something.  Nice shot, but a bit more of the ''surroundings'' might make it more obvious that it''s a reflection.', '2006-05-05 00:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383793, 326697, 53164, '<td valign="top">would have liked this better ifn the lightning was going to the ground.  it would have added a "fear factor" to the image.</td>', 'would have liked this better ifn the lightning was going to the ground.  it would have added a "fear factor" to the image.', '2006-05-05 00:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383794, 328460, 38496, '<td valign="top">great candid... the artist''s concentration is caught well.</td>', 'great candid... the artist''s concentration is caught well.', '2006-05-05 00:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383799, 326474, 38496, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  I hope nobody was hurt!</td>', 'Ouch!  I hope nobody was hurt!', '2006-05-05 00:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383803, 327412, 38496, '<td valign="top">nicely composed.</td>', 'nicely composed.', '2006-05-05 00:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383807, 328506, 38496, '<td valign="top">not overly journalistic.  Nice contrast between the flowers and leaves, though.</td>', 'not overly journalistic.  Nice contrast between the flowers and leaves, though.', '2006-05-05 00:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383813, 325938, 38496, '<td valign="top">nice portrait.  Very crisp.  The background works well for me.</td>', 'nice portrait.  Very crisp.  The background works well for me.', '2006-05-05 00:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383819, 328424, 53164, '<td valign="top">but there is no red carpet. only one guy.</td>', 'but there is no red carpet. only one guy.', '2006-05-05 00:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383849, 328462, 23394, '<td valign="top">a little too tilted.  has that titanic feel to it.  other than that, this is probably publishable.</td>', 'a little too tilted.  has that titanic feel to it.  other than that, this is probably publishable.', '2006-05-05 00:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383851, 328262, 23394, '<td valign="top">this shot has potential.  the weeds in the foreground are extremely distracting, and the toning needs work.  composition is great.  you can practically feel them sliding across the water.</td>', 'this shot has potential.  the weeds in the foreground are extremely distracting, and the toning needs work.  composition is great.  you can practically feel them sliding across the water.', '2006-05-05 00:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383854, 325488, 23394, '<td valign="top">there''s probably a story here, but not the way you''ve shot it.  from this distance, it''s more of a snapshot than a publishable shot.</td>', 'there''s probably a story here, but not the way you''ve shot it.  from this distance, it''s more of a snapshot than a publishable shot.', '2006-05-05 00:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383855, 327491, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent capture.  could use some work on the technicals, but i wouldn''t hold that against you unless you are a professional.  good work!</td>', 'excellent capture.  could use some work on the technicals, but i wouldn''t hold that against you unless you are a professional.  good work!', '2006-05-05 00:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383856, 327353, 53164, '<td valign="top">lol.  that is just hilarious</td>', 'lol.  that is just hilarious', '2006-05-05 00:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383857, 326697, 23394, '<td valign="top">highly unlikely to see this on a front page, unless it''s a REALLY SLOW news day.  this could also use some work on its processing.</td>', 'highly unlikely to see this on a front page, unless it''s a REALLY SLOW news day.  this could also use some work on its processing.', '2006-05-05 00:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383860, 327887, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice photo to illustrate a story.  could use some work on the technicals, but all the same, not bad.</td>', 'nice photo to illustrate a story.  could use some work on the technicals, but all the same, not bad.', '2006-05-05 01:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383864, 328385, 23394, '<td valign="top">honestly, my first reaction was that the guy on the left has a gun, but that just doesn''t seem right.  all the same, i can''t tell what he''s holding.  pretty wild action shot.</td>', 'honestly, my first reaction was that the guy on the left has a gun, but that just doesn''t seem right.  all the same, i can''t tell what he''s holding.  pretty wild action shot.', '2006-05-05 01:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383867, 328131, 23394, '<td valign="top">the title says more than the photo.  it should be the other way around.</td>', 'the title says more than the photo.  it should be the other way around.', '2006-05-05 01:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383870, 328100, 23394, '<td valign="top">i can apprectiate your take on the challenge, but would appreciate the image more if shot from a different angle, something that showed more of the body of the car.</td>', 'i can apprectiate your take on the challenge, but would appreciate the image more if shot from a different angle, something that showed more of the body of the car.', '2006-05-05 01:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2383885, 328387, 53164, '<td valign="top">that ballons growing out of that kids head would have been a bigger story.</td>', 'that ballons growing out of that kids head would have been a bigger story.', '2006-05-05 01:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384375, 328462, 41337, '<td valign="top">That would definitely work for a music cover. 8.</td>', 'That would definitely work for a music cover. 8.', '2006-05-05 05:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384382, 328298, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.</td>', 'Very nice capture.', '2006-05-05 05:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384428, 328190, 41337, '<td valign="top">How long did it take you to find a title that would work for this challenge? Be honest! :P That aside, man what a photo!</td>', 'How long did it take you to find a title that would work for this challenge? Be honest! :P That aside, man what a photo!', '2006-05-05 05:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384552, 326676, 24870, '<td valign="top">Colouring, texture, subject, and leading to subject great. nice image of a gloomy future!</td>', 'Colouring, texture, subject, and leading to subject great. nice image of a gloomy future!', '2006-05-05 07:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384555, 328132, 24870, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the moment just the noise lets it down for me! nice.</td>', 'Great capture of the moment just the noise lets it down for me! nice.', '2006-05-05 07:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384558, 327488, 30456, '<td valign="top">Great angle and lighting.</td>', 'Great angle and lighting.', '2006-05-05 07:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384563, 327963, 24870, '<td valign="top">So glad you captured the child looking back.  Strong message there. Almost looks like he''s reaching his hand out to help... Or point. Either way, great capture of a sad state of life.</td>', 'So glad you captured the child looking back.  Strong message there. Almost looks like he''s reaching his hand out to help... Or point. Either way, great capture of a sad state of life.', '2006-05-05 07:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2384858, 328340, 48228, '<td valign="top">I love this......</td>', 'I love this......', '2006-05-05 10:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
