(2387303, 327640, 48201, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  Did you have to run out of the way to not get sprayed?<br/> <br/>Great shot, well executed, looks like something we''d see in a magazine article about farming or pesticide use.</td>', 'Yikes!  Did you have to run out of the way to not get sprayed? Great shot, well executed, looks like something we''d see in a magazine article about farming or pesticide use.', '2006-05-06 11:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387307, 328218, 48201, '<td valign="top">This is another one for me where it is out of balance as far as "news happening" versus being a great photo.  It''s got tons of real news going down, but we can''t tell what''s blowing up and I''d want to see that better.  You may not have been able to get a better view, but that is what I think would''ve improved this (the pier in the foreground is distracting).</td>', 'This is another one for me where it is out of balance as far as "news happening" versus being a great photo.  It''s got tons of real news going down, but we can''t tell what''s blowing up and I''d want to see that better.  You may not have been able to get a better view, but that is what I think would''ve improved this (the pier in the foreground is distracting).', '2006-05-06 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387308, 326871, 30982, '<td valign="top">Heh!  Great shot - don''t know how you managed to get the action stopped so completely and still get such great lighting.  Very richly detailed and colored.  Title shoehorns it into the challenge, though a bit dubiously.</td>', 'Heh!  Great shot - don''t know how you managed to get the action stopped so completely and still get such great lighting.  Very richly detailed and colored.  Title shoehorns it into the challenge, though a bit dubiously.', '2006-05-06 11:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
