(2387317, 328190, 48201, '<td valign="top">This is one that goes the opposite direction as far as out of balance.<br/> <br/>To me, challenges on this site are about balancing a great photo w/ the definition of the particular challenge.<br/> <br/>This one is a great photo, very beautiful and well executed, but it seems like a bit of a stretch to call it journalism.  If not for your title, I might think it would have nothing to do w/ journalism.</td>', 'This is one that goes the opposite direction as far as out of balance. To me, challenges on this site are about balancing a great photo w/ the definition of the particular challenge. This one is a great photo, very beautiful and well executed, but it seems like a bit of a stretch to call it journalism.  If not for your title, I might think it would have nothing to do w/ journalism.', '2006-05-06 11:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387319, 326209, 30982, '<td valign="top">Good choice for the challenge but lacking a bit in sharpness.</td>', 'Good choice for the challenge but lacking a bit in sharpness.', '2006-05-06 11:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
