(2387323, 328409, 48201, '<td valign="top">Great action moment.  The only thing better would''ve been the look on everyone''s faces as they react to the call.  I think it was in the sports shooting tutorial where it was mentioned that great sports shots don''t always show the action of the play, but sometimes the reactions to it.<br/> <br/>I wish there wasn''t so much dust in the foreground, but I bet you couldn''t do anything about that.</td>', 'Great action moment.  The only thing better would''ve been the look on everyone''s faces as they react to the call.  I think it was in the sports shooting tutorial where it was mentioned that great sports shots don''t always show the action of the play, but sometimes the reactions to it. I wish there wasn''t so much dust in the foreground, but I bet you couldn''t do anything about that.', '2006-05-06 11:48:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387325, 328071, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice shot to accompany the story.  Well exposed to get detail in light and shadowed areas; nice composition.</td>', 'Nice shot to accompany the story.  Well exposed to get detail in light and shadowed areas; nice composition.', '2006-05-06 11:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387326, 328468, 48201, '<td valign="top">I don''t want to sound overly harsh, but I don''t think I will rate this one well.  This looks like a hurried, "I''ve got to get something shot for the challenge and don''t know what to shoot!" type of shots.<br/> <br/>It''s out of focus, not a real interesting image, and not real strong on the journalism part except for the title.<br/> <br/>Take a look around at others in the challenge and find ones you think are great to compare to this one.</td>', 'I don''t want to sound overly harsh, but I don''t think I will rate this one well.  This looks like a hurried, "I''ve got to get something shot for the challenge and don''t know what to shoot!" type of shots. It''s out of focus, not a real interesting image, and not real strong on the journalism part except for the title. Take a look around at others in the challenge and find ones you think are great to compare to this one.', '2006-05-06 11:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387327, 327998, 30982, '<td valign="top">A sponsor''s dream of a shot!  Excellent capture!</td>', 'A sponsor''s dream of a shot!  Excellent capture!', '2006-05-06 11:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387332, 326676, 48201, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image, I could see it on a magazine cover very easily.  This one to me has the balance I am looking for of "great photo" with "looks journalistic".  The only thing I might like better is either a little more detail on the right side or perhaps some of the right side cropped off.  As it is, there''s nothing there, just a 95% black void.</td>', 'Beautiful image, I could see it on a magazine cover very easily.  This one to me has the balance I am looking for of "great photo" with "looks journalistic".  The only thing I might like better is either a little more detail on the right side or perhaps some of the right side cropped off.  As it is, there''s nothing there, just a 95% black void.', '2006-05-06 11:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387337, 326771, 48201, '<td valign="top">Looks like something I''d see in a magazine article for "promoting a healthy lifestyle".  I like the journalism angle to this one.  To me though, it looks a little "overcooked" in PP.</td>', 'Looks like something I''d see in a magazine article for "promoting a healthy lifestyle".  I like the journalism angle to this one.  To me though, it looks a little "overcooked" in PP.', '2006-05-06 11:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387339, 327998, 48201, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  Great clarity and cropped down to give an incredible sense of action.  I could see this one in a motorcycle mag or SI.</td>', 'Very nice!  Great clarity and cropped down to give an incredible sense of action.  I could see this one in a motorcycle mag or SI.', '2006-05-06 11:57:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387347, 328217, 48201, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, this one just doesn''t do it for me as a great shot or journalistic.<br/> <br/>To me, it lacks focus and seems noisy.  Maybe the soft focus was on purpose, but if so, I''d want to see it softer.  It either would need to be very in focus or more out of focus to be more interesting.  As it is, it is between the 2.  It could be cropped tighter too as the bottom part seems irrelevant.<br/> <br/>Those things would maybe make it a better photo, but I still think it would lack any journalistic qualities.</td>', 'Hmmm, this one just doesn''t do it for me as a great shot or journalistic. To me, it lacks focus and seems noisy.  Maybe the soft focus was on purpose, but if so, I''d want to see it softer.  It either would need to be very in focus or more out of focus to be more interesting.  As it is, it is between the 2.  It could be cropped tighter too as the bottom part seems irrelevant. Those things would maybe make it a better photo, but I still think it would lack any journalistic qualities.', '2006-05-06 12:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387348, 327989, 30982, '<td valign="top">What is it with royals and really ugly hats?  This is quite fitting for a front page story, ugly hat and all.</td>', 'What is it with royals and really ugly hats?  This is quite fitting for a front page story, ugly hat and all.', '2006-05-06 12:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387353, 327350, 48201, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I''m not really sure what this one is about.  It doesn''t appear real strong technically (out of focus, no real subject, etc) and it doesn''t look journalistic.  For me, if it is photojournalism, it needs to be fairly clear in the shot what the accompanying text would be talking about.  This one is a couple of guys on a street with video equipment, no idea why they are there or what the point is.</td>', 'Hmmm, I''m not really sure what this one is about.  It doesn''t appear real strong technically (out of focus, no real subject, etc) and it doesn''t look journalistic.  For me, if it is photojournalism, it needs to be fairly clear in the shot what the accompanying text would be talking about.  This one is a couple of guys on a street with video equipment, no idea why they are there or what the point is.', '2006-05-06 12:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387358, 328314, 48201, '<td valign="top">Pretty good.  I might prefer to see the BG done differently.  As is, the colors and lines of the BG take away a little bit from the subject.  Perhaps if the DOF made the BG out of focus it wouldn''t be so noticeable.<br/> <br/>(Looks like she needs some ironing, but that''s not part of my comments on the shot for the challenge)</td>', 'Pretty good.  I might prefer to see the BG done differently.  As is, the colors and lines of the BG take away a little bit from the subject.  Perhaps if the DOF made the BG out of focus it wouldn''t be so noticeable. (Looks like she needs some ironing, but that''s not part of my comments on the shot for the challenge)', '2006-05-06 12:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387361, 327790, 48201, '<td valign="top">Good capture of the action and good balance of technically nice shot w/ journalistic quality.<br/> <br/>(p.s. - hey #32, you''re supposed to keep your eyes on the BALL!)</td>', 'Good capture of the action and good balance of technically nice shot w/ journalistic quality. (p.s. - hey #32, you''re supposed to keep your eyes on the BALL!)', '2006-05-06 12:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387364, 328139, 48201, '<td valign="top">I''m wavering on this one between I really like it and it bothers me.  Perhaps that''s a sign of a good journalistic shot.  I think it is because her right eye is the sharpest point of focus and it seems to be following me, creeping me out a tiny bit!  It does look like something we''d see in a fashion mag, but I think that single point of focus needs to be massaged just a bit.</td>', 'I''m wavering on this one between I really like it and it bothers me.  Perhaps that''s a sign of a good journalistic shot.  I think it is because her right eye is the sharpest point of focus and it seems to be following me, creeping me out a tiny bit!  It does look like something we''d see in a fashion mag, but I think that single point of focus needs to be massaged just a bit.', '2006-05-06 12:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387370, 328288, 48201, '<td valign="top">This one to me is an "almost".  It''s a poignant subject and looks like something we''d see in an article in the paper or a magazine.<br/> <br/>However, it seems to lack a little focus and the washed out colors don''t do it for me.  Don''t know if the colors were done that way on purpose, but they aren''t my fave.<br/> <br/>(at first I thought the cup and taped up bottle over her shoulder were lenses and I was going to ding you for setting up the shot and not using very good props!!  ;-) )</td>', 'This one to me is an "almost".  It''s a poignant subject and looks like something we''d see in an article in the paper or a magazine. However, it seems to lack a little focus and the washed out colors don''t do it for me.  Don''t know if the colors were done that way on purpose, but they aren''t my fave. (at first I thought the cup and taped up bottle over her shoulder were lenses and I was going to ding you for setting up the shot and not using very good props!!  ;-) )', '2006-05-06 12:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387372, 327731, 48201, '<td valign="top">This is another one I''d call an almost.  The subject is interesting, it looks like something that could be in the local papers, but it lacks a bit technically.  The sign and the steam in the BG are a bit too prominent, taking away from the main subject.  The ship could use a bit better focus - perhaps you were shooting from very far away?  I''d also prefer (though you may not have been able to do anything about it) that the fireboat was not in the frame at all.</td>', 'This is another one I''d call an almost.  The subject is interesting, it looks like something that could be in the local papers, but it lacks a bit technically.  The sign and the steam in the BG are a bit too prominent, taking away from the main subject.  The ship could use a bit better focus - perhaps you were shooting from very far away?  I''d also prefer (though you may not have been able to do anything about it) that the fireboat was not in the frame at all.', '2006-05-06 12:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387375, 328071, 48201, '<td valign="top">Nice technically and does look like something we''d see in the papers.<br/> <br/>It won''t affect my rating of this shot, but I don''t think your title needs to be trying to prove this is journalism - the shot does it on its own.  That said, to me the title is not part of the challenge, a good photo showing a journalistic angle is and this one has those.</td>', 'Nice technically and does look like something we''d see in the papers. It won''t affect my rating of this shot, but I don''t think your title needs to be trying to prove this is journalism - the shot does it on its own.  That said, to me the title is not part of the challenge, a good photo showing a journalistic angle is and this one has those.', '2006-05-06 12:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387377, 328282, 48201, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, this one is tough for me to call.  It looks very journalistic - even like you ripped it right out of the sports section.<br/> <br/>But, it isn''t that interesting or intriguing as a photo.  Who is the guy, the coach, a fan, a suspended or injured player?  I''m not sure what would make it better for me, something is needed to pump up the intrigue a little bit.</td>', 'Hmmm, this one is tough for me to call.  It looks very journalistic - even like you ripped it right out of the sports section. But, it isn''t that interesting or intriguing as a photo.  Who is the guy, the coach, a fan, a suspended or injured player?  I''m not sure what would make it better for me, something is needed to pump up the intrigue a little bit.', '2006-05-06 12:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387380, 325938, 48201, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Perfect capture of the crisp military look.  The out of focus BG is ideal, making the only subject matter HIM.<br/> <br/>Not affecting my rating at all, but your title doesn''t need to try to prove this is journalism quite so much in my opinion.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Perfect capture of the crisp military look.  The out of focus BG is ideal, making the only subject matter HIM. Not affecting my rating at all, but your title doesn''t need to try to prove this is journalism quite so much in my opinion.', '2006-05-06 12:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387383, 328497, 48201, '<td valign="top">This one sort of makes me go, "So?"<br/> <br/>There''s a lot of "things" in the shot, but no real point of interest.  A way it could''ve been great was focused in tight on mainly one person - perhaps someone very passionate about the subject and in mid-yell about something.  I''d like to see better focus - the guy right in the middle in the gray shirt is blurred a tad to my eyes.</td>', 'This one sort of makes me go, "So?" There''s a lot of "things" in the shot, but no real point of interest.  A way it could''ve been great was focused in tight on mainly one person - perhaps someone very passionate about the subject and in mid-yell about something.  I''d like to see better focus - the guy right in the middle in the gray shirt is blurred a tad to my eyes.', '2006-05-06 12:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387385, 328266, 48201, '<td valign="top">This one is an excellent photo, would look great framed and on a wall.<br/> <br/>It doesn''t say "journalism" to me though, without the title.  In my opinion, the title shouldn''t really be an important part of the shot or try to explain what it is depicting.</td>', 'This one is an excellent photo, would look great framed and on a wall. It doesn''t say "journalism" to me though, without the title.  In my opinion, the title shouldn''t really be an important part of the shot or try to explain what it is depicting.', '2006-05-06 12:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387389, 326086, 48201, '<td valign="top">Creative idea and well executed.  It''s not my favorite for the challenge and I''m not certain why at this point.  I applaud the creative approach though.</td>', 'Creative idea and well executed.  It''s not my favorite for the challenge and I''m not certain why at this point.  I applaud the creative approach though.', '2006-05-06 12:33:47.000000', NULL, 1),
