(2387426, 328352, 48201, '<td valign="top">There was another large running race shot in this challenge.<br/> <br/>This one is a much stronger composition and I could see it as the lead shot of an article about a local race.<br/> <br/>I''d like it better if the front 2 runners were in sharper focus.</td>', 'There was another large running race shot in this challenge. This one is a much stronger composition and I could see it as the lead shot of an article about a local race. I''d like it better if the front 2 runners were in sharper focus.', '2006-05-06 12:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387428, 327352, 48201, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could be a movie poster.  Very strong shot and very good capture of news happening.  This has a great balance of being journalistic while also being a strong photograph.  One of my highest rated in the challenge.</td>', 'This looks like it could be a movie poster.  Very strong shot and very good capture of news happening.  This has a great balance of being journalistic while also being a strong photograph.  One of my highest rated in the challenge.', '2006-05-06 12:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
