(2387432, 326844, 48201, '<td valign="top">I don''t want to sound mean, but this just doesn''t cut it to me.<br/> <br/>The only link to journalism is the title, and even it isn''t very descriptive (what bet, with whom, why are elected officials gambling, etc.)<br/> <br/>Without the title, I''d think, "Oh, an out of focus shot of plastic flamingos."<br/> <br/>Look at the others you are up against and ask yourself honestly whether this one is up to par as a good shot and as showing any real hint of journalism.</td>', 'I don''t want to sound mean, but this just doesn''t cut it to me. The only link to journalism is the title, and even it isn''t very descriptive (what bet, with whom, why are elected officials gambling, etc.) Without the title, I''d think, "Oh, an out of focus shot of plastic flamingos." Look at the others you are up against and ask yourself honestly whether this one is up to par as a good shot and as showing any real hint of journalism.', '2006-05-06 13:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2387435, 327529, 48201, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  Very nicely done shot, and I could easily see it in a magazine or paper w/ an article about historic trains or this particular one, etc.</td>', 'Gorgeous!  Very nicely done shot, and I could easily see it in a magazine or paper w/ an article about historic trains or this particular one, etc.', '2006-05-06 13:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
