(2388355, 327640, 25952, '<td valign="top">photojournalism usually has to do with people and emotions, but not always. this is a pretty nice mag style shot.</td>', 'photojournalism usually has to do with people and emotions, but not always. this is a pretty nice mag style shot.', '2006-05-06 23:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2388356, 327706, 25952, '<td valign="top">this is not photojournalism. where are the people, where is the emotion? what is happening now that is unusual or different from any other day?</td>', 'this is not photojournalism. where are the people, where is the emotion? what is happening now that is unusual or different from any other day?', '2006-05-06 23:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2388358, 326901, 25952, '<td valign="top">more like a photo illustration...nice composition though...she could stand not to have a block through her head and be a little lighter, but it''s decent shot.</td>', 'more like a photo illustration...nice composition though...she could stand not to have a block through her head and be a little lighter, but it''s decent shot.', '2006-05-06 23:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2388359, 328150, 25952, '<td valign="top">this is a stretch for photojournalism...more like a photo illustration, I think it would be more effective if it were only the yellow rose on the black wall.</td>', 'this is a stretch for photojournalism...more like a photo illustration, I think it would be more effective if it were only the yellow rose on the black wall.', '2006-05-06 23:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2388360, 328529, 25952, '<td valign="top">this is a landscape, not photojournalism.</td>', 'this is a landscape, not photojournalism.', '2006-05-06 23:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2388362, 328293, 25952, '<td valign="top">nice shot, kinda crooked though.</td>', 'nice shot, kinda crooked though.', '2006-05-06 23:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2388367, 328317, 25952, '<td valign="top">this shot is horribly busy. Im not sure how I would have done it differently though. I do like the idea and the composition despite its busyness.</td>', 'this shot is horribly busy. Im not sure how I would have done it differently though. I do like the idea and the composition despite its busyness.', '2006-05-06 23:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2388369, 327623, 25952, '<td valign="top">this says nothing of a protest to me, but props for getting in there and getting an expression of a person, something i have yet to see much of in this challenge and something that is essential to photojournalism.</td>', 'this says nothing of a protest to me, but props for getting in there and getting an expression of a person, something i have yet to see much of in this challenge and something that is essential to photojournalism.', '2006-05-06 23:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2388370, 327910, 25952, '<td valign="top">less sky more people!<br/>nice colors, could use fill flash if you were close enough to kill the crazy shadows on the face.</td>', 'less sky more people!nice colors, could use fill flash if you were close enough to kill the crazy shadows on the face.', '2006-05-06 23:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2388371, 327664, 25952, '<td valign="top">one of the better entries so far, has expression, emotion....story is a bit unclear i guess though, still pretty nice, technically good.</td>', 'one of the better entries so far, has expression, emotion....story is a bit unclear i guess though, still pretty nice, technically good.', '2006-05-06 23:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2388372, 327998, 25952, '<td valign="top">nice, a bit too tight for my tastes though.</td>', 'nice, a bit too tight for my tastes though.', '2006-05-06 23:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2388373, 328132, 25952, '<td valign="top">great expression, i wont comment on the noise cuz, well shooting hockey is going to give u that no matter what. one of the better entries so far...</td>', 'great expression, i wont comment on the noise cuz, well shooting hockey is going to give u that no matter what. one of the better entries so far...', '2006-05-06 23:33:42.000000', NULL, 1);
