(2390863, 327445, 23394, '<td valign="top">very cool that you submitted this.  i shot these a week earlier than the challenge, and they were actually published (the second one on the front page, the first one inside).<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=331227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/23394/thumb/331227.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/23394/thumb/331227.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/23394/thumb/331227.jpg"/></a> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=331226" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/23394/thumb/331226.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/23394/thumb/331226.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/23394/thumb/331226.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>look at them, and tell me the differences between yours and mine.</td>', 'very cool that you submitted this.  i shot these a week earlier than the challenge, and they were actually published (the second one on the front page, the first one inside).    look at them, and tell me the differences between yours and mine.', '2006-05-07 20:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390882, 328071, 23394, '<td valign="top">fine feature photo, but probably not what the typical dpc voter is looking for in this challenge.  you''d probably have done better if you had gone and bout some police tape and created your own crime scene.</td>', 'fine feature photo, but probably not what the typical dpc voter is looking for in this challenge.  you''d probably have done better if you had gone and bout some police tape and created your own crime scene.', '2006-05-07 21:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390885, 328092, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but really shot at the wrong time of day.  great composition and lovely colors, but the high sun is really blowing out the possible details and textures.</td>', 'nice idea, but really shot at the wrong time of day.  great composition and lovely colors, but the high sun is really blowing out the possible details and textures.', '2006-05-07 21:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390887, 325938, 40642, '<td valign="top">I really think you did a wonderful job with this.You can see and feel the pride in this young man! 10</td>', 'I really think you did a wonderful job with this.You can see and feel the pride in this young man! 10', '2006-05-07 21:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390889, 326955, 23394, '<td valign="top">very nicely observed.  probably not a front page/cover photo, but great for capturing the essence of the dancer.  ties very well with your title.</td>', 'very nicely observed.  probably not a front page/cover photo, but great for capturing the essence of the dancer.  ties very well with your title.', '2006-05-07 21:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390895, 328041, 23394, '<td valign="top">you''re probably getting killed for the border.  if not, you should be ;-)<br/> <br/>nice shot, but really should be cropped as tightly as possible.  one of the key elements of PJ is to fill the frame with as much relevant content as possible; here, all that sky and water is wasted space.</td>', 'you''re probably getting killed for the border.  if not, you should be ;-) nice shot, but really should be cropped as tightly as possible.  one of the key elements of PJ is to fill the frame with as much relevant content as possible; here, all that sky and water is wasted space.', '2006-05-07 21:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390897, 327738, 40642, '<td valign="top">I really like the fact it is off center,great timing!10</td>', 'I really like the fact it is off center,great timing!10', '2006-05-07 21:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390899, 328190, 23394, '<td valign="top">beautiful magazine or travel section shot.  too distant, though, to really tie to your title.</td>', 'beautiful magazine or travel section shot.  too distant, though, to really tie to your title.', '2006-05-07 21:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390910, 328111, 40642, '<td valign="top">Great catch!Fits the challenge well.</td>', 'Great catch!Fits the challenge well.', '2006-05-07 21:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390914, 327049, 40642, '<td valign="top">Like the title.Good job.</td>', 'Like the title.Good job.', '2006-05-07 21:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390915, 326474, 40642, '<td valign="top">This says it all!!!!! good job.</td>', 'This says it all!!!!! good job.', '2006-05-07 21:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390916, 327721, 40642, '<td valign="top">Love the sharpness!</td>', 'Love the sharpness!', '2006-05-07 21:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390917, 326209, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  a better photo would have been to have captured them coming towards you.  publications prefer faces to rears, unless there''s some compelling relevance to the overall composition.  here, i don''t see it (compositionally, that is).  otherwise, this is a humorous take on a pretty hefty situation.</td>', 'nice idea.  a better photo would have been to have captured them coming towards you.  publications prefer faces to rears, unless there''s some compelling relevance to the overall composition.  here, i don''t see it (compositionally, that is).  otherwise, this is a humorous take on a pretty hefty situation.', '2006-05-07 21:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390919, 327790, 40642, '<td valign="top">Great timing! Very clear.</td>', 'Great timing! Very clear.', '2006-05-07 21:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390923, 326780, 23394, '<td valign="top">not a chance, unless it is an unbelievably slow news day/week.  nicely observed, but as for the challenge, nada.  sure, it could be published in a nature magazine, but this is a real stretch for ''photojournalism''...</td>', 'not a chance, unless it is an unbelievably slow news day/week.  nicely observed, but as for the challenge, nada.  sure, it could be published in a nature magazine, but this is a real stretch for ''photojournalism''...', '2006-05-07 21:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390925, 327587, 23394, '<td valign="top">beatiful shot, but more of a backpage weather section image than a frontpage/cover photo, dontcha think?  it would be a pretty slow newsday to find this on the front page...</td>', 'beatiful shot, but more of a backpage weather section image than a frontpage/cover photo, dontcha think?  it would be a pretty slow newsday to find this on the front page...', '2006-05-07 21:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390931, 327883, 23394, '<td valign="top">dead-on for meeting the challenge.  would have been stronger with a bit tighter cropping from the top (to make the crowd look a bit denser).</td>', 'dead-on for meeting the challenge.  would have been stronger with a bit tighter cropping from the top (to make the crowd look a bit denser).', '2006-05-07 21:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390937, 328292, 40642, '<td valign="top">Like the look on his face....but would liked to have seen a different color umbrella,maybe black.</td>', 'Like the look on his face....but would liked to have seen a different color umbrella,maybe black.', '2006-05-07 21:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390942, 328274, 40642, '<td valign="top">Great timing, but a little fuzzy.</td>', 'Great timing, but a little fuzzy.', '2006-05-07 21:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390960, 328416, 10818, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is cool, a bit creepy...but I love it.<br/> <br/>Great shot.</td>', 'Wow, that is cool, a bit creepy...but I love it. Great shot.', '2006-05-07 21:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390993, 328203, 23394, '<td valign="top">there is probably a story in this photo, but it should be shot from a different perspective to really bring the story out.  as is, it is more of a snapshot of an event that you were at than a true photojournalistic shot.</td>', 'there is probably a story in this photo, but it should be shot from a different perspective to really bring the story out.  as is, it is more of a snapshot of an event that you were at than a true photojournalistic shot.', '2006-05-07 21:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2390996, 327963, 23394, '<td valign="top">this has a lot of potential.  too bad you didn''t catch any interaction between him and the child, or that you didn''t catch his face.  i could be wrong, but this does seem to be a bit more processed (NI?) than most PJ images</td>', 'this has a lot of potential.  too bad you didn''t catch any interaction between him and the child, or that you didn''t catch his face.  i could be wrong, but this does seem to be a bit more processed (NI?) than most PJ images', '2006-05-07 21:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391000, 328266, 23394, '<td valign="top">maybe...but not likely.  that is, not likely without some more human interest context.  while this is a pretty and interesting image, it doesn''t show any affect on people--and that''s what makes the news.</td>', 'maybe...but not likely.  that is, not likely without some more human interest context.  while this is a pretty and interesting image, it doesn''t show any affect on people--and that''s what makes the news.', '2006-05-07 21:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391003, 327879, 23394, '<td valign="top">fun photo, but it''s not something you would expect to see published, unless it was on a real slow newsday/newsweek.</td>', 'fun photo, but it''s not something you would expect to see published, unless it was on a real slow newsday/newsweek.', '2006-05-07 21:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391012, 327412, 23394, '<td valign="top">awesome shot.  absolutely.  simply fantastic composition.  i will be so pissed if this doesn''t make the dpc front page--it''s one of the best i''ve run across yet.  if this was mine, i''d have it printed 20x30 and dry mounted.  it''s too good not to print.</td>', 'awesome shot.  absolutely.  simply fantastic composition.  i will be so pissed if this doesn''t make the dpc front page--it''s one of the best i''ve run across yet.  if this was mine, i''d have it printed 20x30 and dry mounted.  it''s too good not to print.', '2006-05-07 21:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391015, 326086, 23394, '<td valign="top">not a chance.  if a body was found, it would be the bodybag being photographed.  interesting idea, wrong challenge.</td>', 'not a chance.  if a body was found, it would be the bodybag being photographed.  interesting idea, wrong challenge.', '2006-05-07 21:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391024, 326658, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting photo, but i don''t see anything photojournalistic here.  the idea of photojournalism is primarily to tell visual stories that will grab the reader enough to make them go on and read the paper.  if the picture raises questions that can''t be immediately answered in the caption, then the reader typically doesn''t even touch the story.  this image raises more questions than it answers...</td>', 'interesting photo, but i don''t see anything photojournalistic here.  the idea of photojournalism is primarily to tell visual stories that will grab the reader enough to make them go on and read the paper.  if the picture raises questions that can''t be immediately answered in the caption, then the reader typically doesn''t even touch the story.  this image raises more questions than it answers...', '2006-05-07 22:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391029, 328058, 23394, '<td valign="top">very low quality image.  the idea probably has some potential, but would be better executed if you had shot an extreme closeup of one of the items with some people looking at stuff in the background...</td>', 'very low quality image.  the idea probably has some potential, but would be better executed if you had shot an extreme closeup of one of the items with some people looking at stuff in the background...', '2006-05-07 22:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391033, 325923, 23394, '<td valign="top">this looks like fun, but probably wouldn''t be published, unless it was an extremely slow newsweek for the local community weekly newspaper.</td>', 'this looks like fun, but probably wouldn''t be published, unless it was an extremely slow newsweek for the local community weekly newspaper.', '2006-05-07 22:03:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2391034, 327490, 23394, '<td valign="top">maybe for a travel magazine, but probably not what the dpc voters have in mind for the challenge.  you probably would have done better if you had strung up some yellow police tape out on the rocks and created your own crime scene...</td>', 'maybe for a travel magazine, but probably not what the dpc voters have in mind for the challenge.  you probably would have done better if you had strung up some yellow police tape out on the rocks and created your own crime scene...', '2006-05-07 22:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391038, 328139, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice portrait, but probably the wrong challenge.  sure, this probably could make the cover of a fashion magazine, but there''s a HUGE difference between portraiture and photojournalism...</td>', 'nice portrait, but probably the wrong challenge.  sure, this probably could make the cover of a fashion magazine, but there''s a HUGE difference between portraiture and photojournalism...', '2006-05-07 22:05:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391041, 328317, 23394, '<td valign="top">awesome idea, bad border.  the image is a little rough around the edges, but this is a strong story telling shot.</td>', 'awesome idea, bad border.  the image is a little rough around the edges, but this is a strong story telling shot.', '2006-05-07 22:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391044, 328333, 23394, '<td valign="top">great shot.  definitely captured a moment.  excellent composition.  really, really bad border.  seriously, have you ever seen a border like that in the newspaper?  hopefully for you, the  voters will see past that...</td>', 'great shot.  definitely captured a moment.  excellent composition.  really, really bad border.  seriously, have you ever seen a border like that in the newspaper?  hopefully for you, the  voters will see past that...', '2006-05-07 22:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391047, 328312, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice shot, awful haloing around sky diver.  wouldn''t necessarily consider this photojournalism, but all the same, this probably could get published somewhere.</td>', 'nice shot, awful haloing around sky diver.  wouldn''t necessarily consider this photojournalism, but all the same, this probably could get published somewhere.', '2006-05-07 22:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391049, 327664, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice candid moment.  not really front page material (except on a really slow news day), but it''s the type of stuff weekly papers love.  bad idea with the border, though.</td>', 'nice candid moment.  not really front page material (except on a really slow news day), but it''s the type of stuff weekly papers love.  bad idea with the border, though.', '2006-05-07 22:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391050, 328119, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent shot, excellent composition.  not your typical front page material, but that would depend on the story.  not to sure about the bw treatment, either (very, very few pubs run bw on the fronts).</td>', 'excellent shot, excellent composition.  not your typical front page material, but that would depend on the story.  not to sure about the bw treatment, either (very, very few pubs run bw on the fronts).', '2006-05-07 22:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391053, 326222, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent feature photo.  not necessarily a front page photo, but this is probably publishable somewhere.  this would probably make a nice large print, as well.</td>', 'excellent feature photo.  not necessarily a front page photo, but this is probably publishable somewhere.  this would probably make a nice large print, as well.', '2006-05-07 22:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391057, 328293, 23394, '<td valign="top">definitely publishable image, but your processing could use some work.  the border is a no-no, and the selective editing gives the image a real cut-and-paste feel.  on the other hand, i''ve seen a lot worse than this printed in fairly large papers.</td>', 'definitely publishable image, but your processing could use some work.  the border is a no-no, and the selective editing gives the image a real cut-and-paste feel.  on the other hand, i''ve seen a lot worse than this printed in fairly large papers.', '2006-05-07 22:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391061, 327481, 23394, '<td valign="top">very much the spot news shot; could very well be front page material.  excellent challenge entry, imho.</td>', 'very much the spot news shot; could very well be front page material.  excellent challenge entry, imho.', '2006-05-07 22:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391065, 327770, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent spot news coverage.  too bad you couldn''t get around just a hair to your left; that would have allowed you to frame in a little tighter, eliminating the signs on the far right (they tend to divert attention from your subject).</td>', 'excellent spot news coverage.  too bad you couldn''t get around just a hair to your left; that would have allowed you to frame in a little tighter, eliminating the signs on the far right (they tend to divert attention from your subject).', '2006-05-07 22:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391074, 328035, 23394, '<td valign="top">maybe, but probably not in bw</td>', 'maybe, but probably not in bw', '2006-05-07 22:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391075, 327729, 6179, '<td valign="top">Gruesome.</td>', 'Gruesome.', '2006-05-07 22:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391078, 327893, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but an actual action shot of him on the horn or in the water would be a bit stronger.  the trick is not always to shoot from eye-level.  always be looking for a story-telling perspective, as opposed to documenting things as you see them.</td>', 'nice idea, but an actual action shot of him on the horn or in the water would be a bit stronger.  the trick is not always to shoot from eye-level.  always be looking for a story-telling perspective, as opposed to documenting things as you see them.', '2006-05-07 22:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391080, 327763, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''ve seen that guy.  you should have waited for him to get in the box, and then taken a shot of him from the ground up...</td>', 'i''ve seen that guy.  you should have waited for him to get in the box, and then taken a shot of him from the ground up...', '2006-05-07 22:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391085, 327247, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, you chased a fire truck.  if you''re an amateur, hat''s off to ya.  if you''re a pro, why didn''t you capture something of the emergency that would give the image context?  other than the mask, we don''t have anything here that tells us any of the story.</td>', 'ok, you chased a fire truck.  if you''re an amateur, hat''s off to ya.  if you''re a pro, why didn''t you capture something of the emergency that would give the image context?  other than the mask, we don''t have anything here that tells us any of the story.', '2006-05-07 22:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391097, 327885, 23394, '<td valign="top">probably has some publishing potential, but would have preferred to see it in color (at least around here, only a few papers run bw on their covers, if all...).</td>', 'probably has some publishing potential, but would have preferred to see it in color (at least around here, only a few papers run bw on their covers, if all...).', '2006-05-07 22:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391101, 326901, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent idea.  most of the bottom third of the image should be cropped, though.</td>', 'excellent idea.  most of the bottom third of the image should be cropped, though.', '2006-05-07 22:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391108, 328478, 38496, '<td valign="top">nice picture, but I''m not sure how it''s really photojournalism.</td>', 'nice picture, but I''m not sure how it''s really photojournalism.', '2006-05-07 22:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391111, 327322, 38496, '<td valign="top">nice crisp candid shot. Great expression.</td>', 'nice crisp candid shot. Great expression.', '2006-05-07 22:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391118, 327689, 38496, '<td valign="top">the sky and clouds area really nice.  I little more detail in the foreground would have been good.</td>', 'the sky and clouds area really nice.  I little more detail in the foreground would have been good.', '2006-05-07 22:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391119, 328340, 26464, '<td valign="top">looks cool.. dont know why it would be controversial though</td>', 'looks cool.. dont know why it would be controversial though', '2006-05-07 22:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391121, 327963, 26464, '<td valign="top">wow very powerful... 8</td>', 'wow very powerful... 8', '2006-05-07 22:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391122, 328502, 38496, '<td valign="top">not sure about this being photojournalism.  Nice photo, though.</td>', 'not sure about this being photojournalism.  Nice photo, though.', '2006-05-07 22:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391128, 327697, 38496, '<td valign="top">I like the way the one dancer is looking into the camera, even though it''s a candid shot</td>', 'I like the way the one dancer is looking into the camera, even though it''s a candid shot', '2006-05-07 22:47:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391132, 326871, 38496, '<td valign="top">really nice cat shot, but it''s a stretch for photojournalism.</td>', 'really nice cat shot, but it''s a stretch for photojournalism.', '2006-05-07 22:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
