(2391284, 328217, 46020, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DOF in this pic.  I think I would have tried to go even more shallow.  I think this photo would benifit from a different crop as the bottom half of this pic leaves me wanting more.  I would have tried to emphasize the white petals among the green leaves and the trunk of the tree.  Since this is a photjournalism challenge I would have gone with a title such as "Flower and Garden Show This Weekend" or something like that.<br/> <br/>All comments are meant to be constructave.  Please take them as such.  Good luck in this challenge!</td>', 'I like the shallow DOF in this pic.  I think I would have tried to go even more shallow.  I think this photo would benifit from a different crop as the bottom half of this pic leaves me wanting more.  I would have tried to emphasize the white petals among the green leaves and the trunk of the tree.  Since this is a photjournalism challenge I would have gone with a title such as "Flower and Garden Show This Weekend" or something like that. All comments are meant to be constructave.  Please take them as such.  Good luck in this challenge!', '2006-05-07 23:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2391301, 328276, 46020, '<td valign="top">Nothing really jumps out at me with this photo.  The only thing I can think to share with you is this:  When I think of photojournalism I think of someone behind the camera snapping away as the action unfolds before them.  Although staged well, this pic <b>IS</b> staged.  Not my Idea of photojournalism.  Just my 2 cents.<br/> <br/>In this challenge I am only commenting.<br/> <br/>All comments are meant to be constructave.  Please take them as such.  Good luck in this challenge!</td>', 'Nothing really jumps out at me with this photo.  The only thing I can think to share with you is this:  When I think of photojournalism I think of someone behind the camera snapping away as the action unfolds before them.  Although staged well, this pic IS staged.  Not my Idea of photojournalism.  Just my 2 cents. In this challenge I am only commenting. All comments are meant to be constructave.  Please take them as such.  Good luck in this challenge!', '2006-05-08 00:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
