(2391568, 327963, 28710, '<td valign="top">As another asian resident, I also see this all the time and it bothers me a lot at how callous people are towards these individuals. They get jaded because of so many people who try to make an extra scene of themselves... I''ve seen people using magic markers, lipstick and nail polish to try to accentuate minor and sometimes non-existant wounds.<br/> <br/>So it is not surprising that people are cold to this type of person.<br/> <br/>But when you see the ones that are genuinely damaged goods, it is heartbreaking to see the apathy around them.<br/> <br/>Your picture has captured a beautiful moment where the innocence of youth shows through as unmarred by the distant uncaring stance of the adults around. Great stuff!<br/> <br/>It is interesting to see the difference in individuals in these situations. The ones that are in real dire straits often appreciate a few kind words as much as a small donation.</td>', 'As another asian resident, I also see this all the time and it bothers me a lot at how callous people are towards these individuals. They get jaded because of so many people who try to make an extra scene of themselves... I''ve seen people using magic markers, lipstick and nail polish to try to accentuate minor and sometimes non-existant wounds. So it is not surprising that people are cold to this type of person. But when you see the ones that are genuinely damaged goods, it is heartbreaking to see the apathy around them. Your picture has captured a beautiful moment where the innocence of youth shows through as unmarred by the distant uncaring stance of the adults around. Great stuff! It is interesting to see the difference in individuals in these situations. The ones that are in real dire straits often appreciate a few kind words as much as a small donation.', '2006-05-08 01:36:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391569, 326771, 46778, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all of your great comments. This is the West end part of Nashville for the "Country Music Run". There are 20 bands through out the run to play music for the runers. <br/> <br/>I got several comments about showing people runnig towards the camera. I agree that it may look better, but I was hang over that moring at 7 am and not about to walk all the way down the street to show a shoot up the hill. Plus i like showing the massive amount of people running. I have about twenty shoots of the event and some look towards the crowd, but they did not look as impressive as this shoot. <br/> <br/>My thought on post prosseing... Still getting used to my Mac.. News shoots do not get edited as much as DPC users tend to like, it''s all about making the next edition.... (yes I may have gone over the top, but loved the colors)<br/> <br/>As far as the titel... DEAD ON , something similar was shown in the paper the next day as a head line (Big event in Nashville). <br/> <br/>Thank you again.. :)<br/> <br/>Edit: Spelling - lot''s more<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-08 00:38:49.</i></td>', 'Thank you for all of your great comments. This is the West end part of Nashville for the "Country Music Run". There are 20 bands through out the run to play music for the runers.  I got several comments about showing people runnig towards the camera. I agree that it may look better, but I was hang over that moring at 7 am and not about to walk all the way down the street to show a shoot up the hill. Plus i like showing the massive amount of people running. I have about twenty shoots of the event and some look towards the crowd, but they did not look as impressive as this shoot.  My thought on post prosseing... Still getting used to my Mac.. News shoots do not get edited as much as DPC users tend to like, it''s all about making the next edition.... (yes I may have gone over the top, but loved the colors) As far as the titel... DEAD ON , something similar was shown in the paper the next day as a head line (Big event in Nashville).  Thank you again.. :) Edit: Spelling - lot''s more', '2006-05-08 01:36:32.000000', '2006-05-08 01:38:49.000000', 0),
