(2391867, 327721, 6912, '<td valign="top">YAHOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!!! Congratulations Larus!</td>', 'YAHOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!!! Congratulations Larus!', '2006-05-08 02:39:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391886, 328416, 36065, '<td valign="top">--Trading Post Comment-- <br/>Very interesting.  You have several elements working together in this shot to keep the eye moving all around the frame.  You''ve captured a very interesting scene, and your placement of the actor is priceless.  Nice background hair.  The shot immediately gave me a smile.  I think it could have been better without the harsh lighting on his face, but we can''t control everything.  Nice score.</td>', '--Trading Post Comment-- Very interesting.  You have several elements working together in this shot to keep the eye moving all around the frame.  You''ve captured a very interesting scene, and your placement of the actor is priceless.  Nice background hair.  The shot immediately gave me a smile.  I think it could have been better without the harsh lighting on his face, but we can''t control everything.  Nice score.', '2006-05-08 02:48:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391902, 327441, 47482, '<td valign="top">i''m sorry i missed this in voting, would have given you a 10, this image should not have got the low scores.<br/> <br/>Well done! and sorry again!<br/> <br/>have added your photo and you as a fav.</td>', 'i''m sorry i missed this in voting, would have given you a 10, this image should not have got the low scores. Well done! and sorry again! have added your photo and you as a fav.', '2006-05-08 02:53:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391907, 328214, 38496, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot... makes me want to go to the circus!<br/>compostion:  If you had panned out just slightly so that the crop wasn''t so tight, I think it might have looked a bit better.  As is the feet of the trainer are cut off, and the elephants look slightly off balance.<br/>suject:  this is great.  You caught the elephants at a great moment.<br/>technical: I''m sure the lighting was tricky, and this turned out pretty well.  I know nothing about PS, so I can''t make any comments about post processing.<br/>This shot does a great job of capturing the ''essence'' of the circus, which is what photojournalism should do.</td>', 'This is a great shot... makes me want to go to the circus!compostion:  If you had panned out just slightly so that the crop wasn''t so tight, I think it might have looked a bit better.  As is the feet of the trainer are cut off, and the elephants look slightly off balance.suject:  this is great.  You caught the elephants at a great moment.technical: I''m sure the lighting was tricky, and this turned out pretty well.  I know nothing about PS, so I can''t make any comments about post processing.This shot does a great job of capturing the ''essence'' of the circus, which is what photojournalism should do.', '2006-05-08 02:54:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391921, 328213, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this photo, but I am not sure it works for me.  If it had not been for the title I would have missed the message.  I like the monochromatic approach.  I wish smoke from the stack was evident.  It seems like it is a cloudy day, but I can''t see any smoke on my monitor.  Looks like a car is approaching from the right.  It''s a bit distracting.  (This may sound a bit negative...that''s not my intention.)</td>', 'I like the idea of this photo, but I am not sure it works for me.  If it had not been for the title I would have missed the message.  I like the monochromatic approach.  I wish smoke from the stack was evident.  It seems like it is a cloudy day, but I can''t see any smoke on my monitor.  Looks like a car is approaching from the right.  It''s a bit distracting.  (This may sound a bit negative...that''s not my intention.)', '2006-05-08 02:59:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391926, 327721, 22781, '<td valign="top">Congrats, great picture!</td>', 'Congrats, great picture!', '2006-05-08 03:00:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391933, 328213, 36065, '<td valign="top">--Trading Post Comment-- <br/>I think this one suffered from a bit of overexposure, but you chose a really tough range of lighting to include.  It is really tough to get all the necessary detail when you have a dark area like the tire and a really bright area like the diffused sky.  A GND filter would help out a great deal, but it would be tough even with a strong one.  Pretty good composition, but I''d rather see the full tire in the frame.  There is also a distracting reflection around the tire and bumper.  Cool scene, but better execution was possible.</td>', '--Trading Post Comment-- I think this one suffered from a bit of overexposure, but you chose a really tough range of lighting to include.  It is really tough to get all the necessary detail when you have a dark area like the tire and a really bright area like the diffused sky.  A GND filter would help out a great deal, but it would be tough even with a strong one.  Pretty good composition, but I''d rather see the full tire in the frame.  There is also a distracting reflection around the tire and bumper.  Cool scene, but better execution was possible.', '2006-05-08 03:04:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391938, 328317, 37858, '<td valign="top">I like this photo quite a bit.  I read your comments before posting this comment. As far as I am concerned, "photojournalism" is a broad enough catagory to include this picture.  It would have been nice if the background were not quite so distracting...but we don''t get to place our bus stops where we like them. : )<br/> <br/>Good crisp focus and colors.  Since this wasn''t posed I guess you got lucky with the umbrella and tennis ball.  I love their body language too.  I would have voted a 6 on this one, 7 if the background wasn''t so busy.</td>', 'I like this photo quite a bit.  I read your comments before posting this comment. As far as I am concerned, "photojournalism" is a broad enough catagory to include this picture.  It would have been nice if the background were not quite so distracting...but we don''t get to place our bus stops where we like them. : ) Good crisp focus and colors.  Since this wasn''t posed I guess you got lucky with the umbrella and tennis ball.  I love their body language too.  I would have voted a 6 on this one, 7 if the background wasn''t so busy.', '2006-05-08 03:06:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391942, 328041, 38496, '<td valign="top">Where was this taken?  The water is gorgeous!  And it looks like it''s warm!<br/>compostion:  I would have liked this a bit better if was framed more to the left, so that the winning surfer is sailing into the frame, instead of out of it.  Or else a tighter crop on the main windsurfer.  All the empty space to the right doesn''t really add anything.<br/>subject:  Nice enough.  It fits the challenge well.<br/>technical:  The colors work really well, and the focus seems to be sharp(I need glasses, so I can''t really swear that it is Ü)<br/>summary:  This is a nice shot, that would have been a great shot if the framing were slightly different.<br/></td>', 'Where was this taken?  The water is gorgeous!  And it looks like it''s warm!compostion:  I would have liked this a bit better if was framed more to the left, so that the winning surfer is sailing into the frame, instead of out of it.  Or else a tighter crop on the main windsurfer.  All the empty space to the right doesn''t really add anything.subject:  Nice enough.  It fits the challenge well.technical:  The colors work really well, and the focus seems to be sharp(I need glasses, so I can''t really swear that it is Ü)summary:  This is a nice shot, that would have been a great shot if the framing were slightly different.', '2006-05-08 03:06:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391950, 327721, 50674, '<td valign="top">Lárus, þetta er aldeilis frábær árangur, fín mynd. Congrats, til hamingju.</td>', 'Lárus, þetta er aldeilis frábær árangur, fín mynd. Congrats, til hamingju.', '2006-05-08 03:09:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391954, 328317, 36065, '<td valign="top">--Trading Post Comment-- <br/>Nice score, and I don''t see anything wrong with the border.  I think that the composition could have benefited from shifting a bit to the left.  The gentleman on the left is a bit too close to the frame''s edge for me.  Terrific colors and wonderful clarity.  I think that the 640 pixels allowed here really limited the score that this one could have bought. Nice work!</td>', '--Trading Post Comment-- Nice score, and I don''t see anything wrong with the border.  I think that the composition could have benefited from shifting a bit to the left.  The gentleman on the left is a bit too close to the frame''s edge for me.  Terrific colors and wonderful clarity.  I think that the 640 pixels allowed here really limited the score that this one could have bought. Nice work!', '2006-05-08 03:10:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391972, 328403, 37858, '<td valign="top">I love the subject matter - the baby''s reaction to Spongebob is priceless.  On the other hand, I''m not sure it fits really well with the "photojournalism" topic, even with a fairly broad definition...unless we include the "neighborhood news" section of the local paper(in which case, almost anything goes).  <br/> <br/>I like the tight cropping for this picture because a wider picture would probably include a lot of distractions.  The blurring of the background also helps focus on the moment and the baby.</td>', 'I love the subject matter - the baby''s reaction to Spongebob is priceless.  On the other hand, I''m not sure it fits really well with the "photojournalism" topic, even with a fairly broad definition...unless we include the "neighborhood news" section of the local paper(in which case, almost anything goes).   I like the tight cropping for this picture because a wider picture would probably include a lot of distractions.  The blurring of the background also helps focus on the moment and the baby.', '2006-05-08 03:15:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391981, 327721, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOO HOO! I''m sooooo glad you won.  This was my most favorite of the entire challenge.  BRAVO</td>', 'WOO HOO! I''m sooooo glad you won.  This was my most favorite of the entire challenge.  BRAVO', '2006-05-08 03:16:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2391983, 326676, 15711, '<td valign="top">Look at you!!! 7th place.  YIPPEE! Congratulations.</td>', 'Look at you!!! 7th place.  YIPPEE! Congratulations.', '2006-05-08 03:17:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392010, 326052, 28742, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the great finish, Leslie! A signature shot. Too bad the kid on the left spilled his Starbucks down the front of his shirt before school. ;-)</td>', 'Congrats on the great finish, Leslie! A signature shot. Too bad the kid on the left spilled his Starbucks down the front of his shirt before school. ;-)', '2006-05-08 03:25:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392015, 327317, 37858, '<td valign="top">If I hadn''t read your comments I wouldn''t have found anything exceptional about this guy - except that he has an expressive face (that''s probably because there is no way to photograph a person to reveal their speech).  Fairly clean socks don''t suggest hard times either.  I do think this photo is a good portrait.  I like the slight blurring of the background so as to reduce distractions.  The monochromatic tone works well too.</td>', 'If I hadn''t read your comments I wouldn''t have found anything exceptional about this guy - except that he has an expressive face (that''s probably because there is no way to photograph a person to reveal their speech).  Fairly clean socks don''t suggest hard times either.  I do think this photo is a good portrait.  I like the slight blurring of the background so as to reduce distractions.  The monochromatic tone works well too.', '2006-05-08 03:28:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392032, 327441, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really a nice image.  Maybe not for photojournalism per se, but I do like the arms/torso approach you took. Nice in black and white too. It neutralizes any color variations and you just concentrate on the shadows and lights. The slightly off centered composition is one of my favorites.</td>', 'Really a nice image.  Maybe not for photojournalism per se, but I do like the arms/torso approach you took. Nice in black and white too. It neutralizes any color variations and you just concentrate on the shadows and lights. The slightly off centered composition is one of my favorites.', '2006-05-08 03:31:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392063, 328403, 36065, '<td valign="top">Nice photo-journalistic capture, but it really lacks any one area of interest.  The kid''s expression and captivation with the stuffed toy is nice, but he gets lost in the shadow.  The cute mom would make an interesting subject, but her face is partially hidden. I agree that this one would also work well in a tabloid-type magazine.  Crisp focus and nice exposure with the difficult lighting conditions, but some room for improvement.</td>', 'Nice photo-journalistic capture, but it really lacks any one area of interest.  The kid''s expression and captivation with the stuffed toy is nice, but he gets lost in the shadow.  The cute mom would make an interesting subject, but her face is partially hidden. I agree that this one would also work well in a tabloid-type magazine.  Crisp focus and nice exposure with the difficult lighting conditions, but some room for improvement.', '2006-05-08 03:38:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392068, 328416, 37858, '<td valign="top">Nice placement of the central figure.  The colors seem a bit faded to me (chiefly because gas containers are usually a vivid red and this one seems a bit washed out - of course it could be the sunlight, too).  Good sense of humour in this one.</td>', 'Nice placement of the central figure.  The colors seem a bit faded to me (chiefly because gas containers are usually a vivid red and this one seems a bit washed out - of course it could be the sunlight, too).  Good sense of humour in this one.', '2006-05-08 03:38:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392074, 326052, 31885, '<td valign="top">I can only remember smiling like that when the bell went for end of school! Great shot, cuz!</td>', 'I can only remember smiling like that when the bell went for end of school! Great shot, cuz!', '2006-05-08 03:40:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392078, 327996, 24503, '<td valign="top">Nice shot with a really adecuate crop. You captured well an action moment. Composition is nice, with the diagonal created by the girl in red. The colors seem a bit washed to me, maybe you could work it to have little more contrast. The focus is OK, but sharpness in your subject could be a little more tack.<br/>To improve: the BG is a bit distracting, with that people on a tent.<br/>Good job overall.<br/> <br/>Álex.</td>', 'Nice shot with a really adecuate crop. You captured well an action moment. Composition is nice, with the diagonal created by the girl in red. The colors seem a bit washed to me, maybe you could work it to have little more contrast. The focus is OK, but sharpness in your subject could be a little more tack.To improve: the BG is a bit distracting, with that people on a tent.Good job overall. Álex.', '2006-05-08 03:40:58.000000', NULL, 0),
