(2392142, 327488, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. I''m wondering if this was hurt because it looked like a setup shot vs capturing something real. The lack of logos/decals on their shirts adds to that perception. The guy at the top in the white clearly has it but he isn''t as noticeble.</td>', 'Very nice photo. I''m wondering if this was hurt because it looked like a setup shot vs capturing something real. The lack of logos/decals on their shirts adds to that perception. The guy at the top in the white clearly has it but he isn''t as noticeble.', '2006-05-08 04:02:06.000000', NULL, 0),
