(2392672, 327021, 24503, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot and good score, Gunnar. <br/>Composition is very dynamic, with your elements well distributed in the image, but to me there too much black in the image, maybe you could capture a bit of detail in your subject. <br/>About the colors, good use of silhouettes in black and color of BG.<br/>To improve: It seems you had some problems in the jpeg conversion because there are some visible artifacts, not very sure why.<br/>Overall, a nice image that needs, IMO, more details in the subject.<br/> <br/>Álex</td>', 'Very nice shot and good score, Gunnar. Composition is very dynamic, with your elements well distributed in the image, but to me there too much black in the image, maybe you could capture a bit of detail in your subject. About the colors, good use of silhouettes in black and color of BG.To improve: It seems you had some problems in the jpeg conversion because there are some visible artifacts, not very sure why.Overall, a nice image that needs, IMO, more details in the subject. Álex', '2006-05-08 09:11:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392700, 327501, 23394, '<td valign="top">yeah, too bad the challenge wasn''t a week later and the race a week earlier ;-)</td>', 'yeah, too bad the challenge wasn''t a week later and the race a week earlier ;-)', '2006-05-08 09:26:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392733, 327998, 19978, '<td valign="top">Incredible sharpness considering you were motion panning and shot at only 1/100s. Outstanding job!</td>', 'Incredible sharpness considering you were motion panning and shot at only 1/100s. Outstanding job!', '2006-05-08 09:42:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392736, 327910, 38496, '<td valign="top">Nice bright colors.  I love the clouds/sky,  but I''m not a huge fan of too much ''empty'' space.  I would have liked to see more of the people.  The cut off elbos bugs me a bit.  Maybe framed so that all you see as the background is sky, still, but with more of th people?  Shot from really low maybe?  Just a thought.  I love the expressions on their faces - it looks like they are having a blast.  The colors are great, and exposure is good.  Maybe a little fill flash to even out the shadows on their faces?  Overall, this is a really bright, fun photo.  Makes me want to visit Austin again.</td>', 'Nice bright colors.  I love the clouds/sky,  but I''m not a huge fan of too much ''empty'' space.  I would have liked to see more of the people.  The cut off elbos bugs me a bit.  Maybe framed so that all you see as the background is sky, still, but with more of th people?  Shot from really low maybe?  Just a thought.  I love the expressions on their faces - it looks like they are having a blast.  The colors are great, and exposure is good.  Maybe a little fill flash to even out the shadows on their faces?  Overall, this is a really bright, fun photo.  Makes me want to visit Austin again.', '2006-05-08 09:43:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392750, 327021, 38496, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool looking shot.  I love the silohuette idea.  Very striking.  It looks ''early morning'' to me.  The lights in the background give it some depth.  The compostion works really well with the worker walking towards the ''machine'' (I never can tell the difference between cranes, excavators, backhoes etc Ü).  I don''t have any ideas on what to improve here - love the shot the way it is.</td>', 'This is a very cool looking shot.  I love the silohuette idea.  Very striking.  It looks ''early morning'' to me.  The lights in the background give it some depth.  The compostion works really well with the worker walking towards the ''machine'' (I never can tell the difference between cranes, excavators, backhoes etc Ü).  I don''t have any ideas on what to improve here - love the shot the way it is.', '2006-05-08 09:50:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392751, 328471, 50695, '<td valign="top">I was your 10. This is an excellent shot, because it evokes the magic of entertainment, and the creepiness of it. I bet plenty of newspapers would love to run a shot like this of a local event.</td>', 'I was your 10. This is an excellent shot, because it evokes the magic of entertainment, and the creepiness of it. I bet plenty of newspapers would love to run a shot like this of a local event.', '2006-05-08 09:50:09.000000', NULL, 0),
