(2392758, 327721, 23394, '<td valign="top">excellent shot!  these are so difficult, you deserve everything you''re getting as a result.  keep it up!</td>', 'excellent shot!  these are so difficult, you deserve everything you''re getting as a result.  keep it up!', '2006-05-08 09:54:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392769, 327721, 9821, '<td valign="top">about time you turned one of those stars into a ribbon on your profile page :)</td>', 'about time you turned one of those stars into a ribbon on your profile page :)', '2006-05-08 09:58:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392773, 328292, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love this picture but no newspaper would take a random guy on the street shot and put that headline under it. They''d get sued!</td>', 'I love this picture but no newspaper would take a random guy on the street shot and put that headline under it. They''d get sued!', '2006-05-08 10:00:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392780, 327412, 49652, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your ribbon.  I really liked this image.</td>', 'Congrats on your ribbon.  I really liked this image.', '2006-05-08 10:03:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392829, 328218, 49652, '<td valign="top">Awesone.  Congrats on an excellent finish.</td>', 'Awesone.  Congrats on an excellent finish.', '2006-05-08 10:27:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392832, 327963, 49652, '<td valign="top">Very powerful picture.  I like how the baby is looking back at him.</td>', 'Very powerful picture.  I like how the baby is looking back at him.', '2006-05-08 10:29:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392842, 328214, 24503, '<td valign="top">really wonderful. <br/>Like the composition, very dynamic and the crop is OK. <br/>The colors and white balance is great, in a dificult conditions, I guess. The sharpness is good.<br/>The subject is funny, you captured the moment very well and you include all the important things in the shot.<br/>To improve: sorry, but I can''t think of anything. like it this way.<br/>Well done.<br/> <br/>Álex</td>', 'really wonderful. Like the composition, very dynamic and the crop is OK. The colors and white balance is great, in a dificult conditions, I guess. The sharpness is good.The subject is funny, you captured the moment very well and you include all the important things in the shot.To improve: sorry, but I can''t think of anything. like it this way.Well done. Álex', '2006-05-08 10:32:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392848, 327640, 49652, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the excellent finish.  This was one of my favorites from the challenge.  Well done and nice ducking!</td>', 'Congrats on the excellent finish.  This was one of my favorites from the challenge.  Well done and nice ducking!', '2006-05-08 10:34:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392858, 326278, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading Post...<br/>  I thought this was a great idea. It just didn''t seem to be executed real well. During voting I gave this a 5 because though it does seem like it could be an old prison, it seems more like a gated alley with a street light in the background. The darkness and lack of a subject failed to hold my interest.</td>', 'Trading Post...  I thought this was a great idea. It just didn''t seem to be executed real well. During voting I gave this a 5 because though it does seem like it could be an old prison, it seems more like a gated alley with a street light in the background. The darkness and lack of a subject failed to hold my interest.', '2006-05-08 10:37:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392863, 327910, 24503, '<td valign="top">Funny shot. I''ve read your comment, and I had some opinions about negative space as you. If you think of it, maybe they are right. But it''s important you like it. Anyway, here goes my critique:<br/>Composition: I think it''s OK, but maybe the subject is too small in the photo. It''s a bit strange to see this people without knowing where they are, what is the context of the photo. The moment you captured is quite funny.<br/>Colors: wonderfully bright and saturated. Like them.<br/>To improve: maybe put the subject in the context.<br/>Good job and keep shooting.<br/> <br/>Álex.</td>', 'Funny shot. I''ve read your comment, and I had some opinions about negative space as you. If you think of it, maybe they are right. But it''s important you like it. Anyway, here goes my critique:Composition: I think it''s OK, but maybe the subject is too small in the photo. It''s a bit strange to see this people without knowing where they are, what is the context of the photo. The moment you captured is quite funny.Colors: wonderfully bright and saturated. Like them.To improve: maybe put the subject in the context.Good job and keep shooting. Álex.', '2006-05-08 10:39:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392883, 328213, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  I really liked this. I''m surprised it didn''t do better. It seems a good ''commentary piece'' photo. The light and shadow played well together and the factory in the background was a brillant touch. Be proud of this regardless of the score.</td>', 'Trading post...  I really liked this. I''m surprised it didn''t do better. It seems a good ''commentary piece'' photo. The light and shadow played well together and the factory in the background was a brillant touch. Be proud of this regardless of the score.', '2006-05-08 10:45:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392901, 328317, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  First off, I voted a 6 on this. I thought it was a great photograph and really tells a story about the division between people. What I thought could have made it better was if both benches were fully in the frame. It just seems that part of the photo was cut off. Nothing you could really do about that though without losing some of the details of the people. Great job!</td>', 'Trading post...  First off, I voted a 6 on this. I thought it was a great photograph and really tells a story about the division between people. What I thought could have made it better was if both benches were fully in the frame. It just seems that part of the photo was cut off. Nothing you could really do about that though without losing some of the details of the people. Great job!', '2006-05-08 10:58:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392922, 327068, 57886, '<td valign="top">This one I like alot :o)You captured a pic which you can say is humorous, jet very serious... Good colors... Actually gave it my best.</td>', 'This one I like alot :o)You captured a pic which you can say is humorous, jet very serious... Good colors... Actually gave it my best.', '2006-05-08 11:06:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392928, 327317, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>   I actually voted this a 7. I''m surprised it didn''t do better. Great facial expression. The feet were blown out though. If you look close you can see toes, otherwise it looks like socks. I guess the ''clean'' look of him hurt you as homeless usually equals dirty.</td>', 'Trading post...   I actually voted this a 7. I''m surprised it didn''t do better. Great facial expression. The feet were blown out though. If you look close you can see toes, otherwise it looks like socks. I guess the ''clean'' look of him hurt you as homeless usually equals dirty.', '2006-05-08 11:08:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392965, 328403, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>   I gave this a 6. There is a lot that could be improved on in this one, but that''s true of most newspaper shots. Since the baby seems to be the focus it would have been nice to see more of his/her face. The  focus also seems to be a bit soft.</td>', 'Trading post...   I gave this a 6. There is a lot that could be improved on in this one, but that''s true of most newspaper shots. Since the baby seems to be the focus it would have been nice to see more of his/her face. The  focus also seems to be a bit soft.', '2006-05-08 11:18:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392983, 327998, 45654, '<td valign="top">I love it! just an awsume shot, I hope to grab some shots like this in the summer.</td>', 'I love it! just an awsume shot, I hope to grab some shots like this in the summer.', '2006-05-08 11:26:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392984, 327317, 53147, '<td valign="top">Way to go in actually engaging your subject before shooting. I have not really gotten the guts to do that whole hog yet. I figured he was homeless, but he does look pretty clean and orderly. His socks look in better condition than my own. I think that if you had captured a shot that was more candid - with him looking down or away - you would have scored higher. Technically the pic seems fine. Good detail and sharpness, duotones work well. The overall interest level just isnt high in my opinion. A grungier guy or different pose would have helped change that.</td>', 'Way to go in actually engaging your subject before shooting. I have not really gotten the guts to do that whole hog yet. I figured he was homeless, but he does look pretty clean and orderly. His socks look in better condition than my own. I think that if you had captured a shot that was more candid - with him looking down or away - you would have scored higher. Technically the pic seems fine. Good detail and sharpness, duotones work well. The overall interest level just isnt high in my opinion. A grungier guy or different pose would have helped change that.', '2006-05-08 11:27:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2392986, 327579, 56658, '<td valign="top">I gave this one a 6. I like the idea of the shot, and the engine in the middle cracks me up. I think I would have liked more detail (closer) in thier expressions and what was realling going on with the boat or a further shot that showed more of the rapids kinda given a sense of impending doom.</td>', 'I gave this one a 6. I like the idea of the shot, and the engine in the middle cracks me up. I think I would have liked more detail (closer) in thier expressions and what was realling going on with the boat or a further shot that showed more of the rapids kinda given a sense of impending doom.', '2006-05-08 11:27:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(2393032, 327412, 32767, '<td valign="top">Eugene-Congrats on your first Ribbon!!!<br/>Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Eugene-Congrats on your first Ribbon!!!Beautiful shot.', '2006-05-08 11:39:57.000000', NULL, 0),
