(2393145, 325627, 24454, '<td valign="top">What an AMAZING photo!!  Congratulations Dawn on a well-deserved top 10 placing!   This is true photojournalism and well-worth all the trouble you went throught to capture it again for the challenge :)</td>', 'What an AMAZING photo!!  Congratulations Dawn on a well-deserved top 10 placing!   This is true photojournalism and well-worth all the trouble you went throught to capture it again for the challenge :)', '2006-05-08 12:16:59.000000', NULL, 0),
