(2393494, 327998, 4411, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by fotomann_forever:</b></div><hr/><i> Your first attempt at motorbike photography? OMG, I can''t wait to see the other attempts.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>I guess I ought to qualify the "first attempt" statement with "after 4 or 5 years practice shooting cars" for those that don''t know.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kiwiness:</b></div><hr/><i>Y0u gonna stick around now?</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Dunno. I''ve proved my godlike mastery of my new camera now haven''t I ...<br/> <br/>:D<br/> <br/>Yeah I''m here until my next photographic hibernation.<br/>Thanks for all the great comments peeps.</td>', 'Originally posted by fotomann_forever: Your first attempt at motorbike photography? OMG, I can''t wait to see the other attempts. I guess I ought to qualify the "first attempt" statement with "after 4 or 5 years practice shooting cars" for those that don''t know. Originally posted by kiwiness:Y0u gonna stick around now? Dunno. I''ve proved my godlike mastery of my new camera now haven''t I ... :D Yeah I''m here until my next photographic hibernation.Thanks for all the great comments peeps.', '2006-05-08 13:53:46.000000', NULL, 0),
