(2393513, 328298, 5885, '<td valign="top">Actually, I didn''t see anything wrong wit the title here. It seemed feature photo-ish to me, so no need to work on the title.<br/> <br/>I id have issues with the dark lighting on the child, but that would have been very hard to fix in-camera. Perhaps a bit of dodging would have helped some. <br/> <br/>Over-all, I thought it was a nice photo and scored fairly well.</td>', 'Actually, I didn''t see anything wrong wit the title here. It seemed feature photo-ish to me, so no need to work on the title. I id have issues with the dark lighting on the child, but that would have been very hard to fix in-camera. Perhaps a bit of dodging would have helped some.  Over-all, I thought it was a nice photo and scored fairly well.', '2006-05-08 13:59:03.000000', NULL, 0),
