(2395780, 327910, 49202, '<td valign="top"><b>From the CTP MkII<br/>Disclaimer:</b> The following crits are personal opinions, not photographic dogmas. Please see them as suggestions, not claims of mastery nor a show of hauteur.;p<br/> <br/><b>First Impression:</b> Now this I like. Even more than elephants.XD A 9, because it''s more fun than elephants and circuses, which dominate fun charts.<br/><b>Composition:</b> To heck with the rules of composition, this composition WORKS for the photo. 8!<br/><b>Subject:</b> Funky subjects who look like hippies are cool. 10.<br/><b>Technical:</b> 8. Sharpness''s fine, colors rule, contrast rocks, but shadows poop.<br/><b>Improvement:</b> Fill-in flash and flying ninjas.<br/><b>Summary:</b> Since you''re last on the list, you''re my last "critiquee". Thanks for capping off my critiquing session with fun. I''m a number too short on screws in the head so please do not be offended.;p <br/> <br/></td>', 'From the CTP MkIIDisclaimer: The following crits are personal opinions, not photographic dogmas. Please see them as suggestions, not claims of mastery nor a show of hauteur.;p First Impression: Now this I like. Even more than elephants.XD A 9, because it''s more fun than elephants and circuses, which dominate fun charts.Composition: To heck with the rules of composition, this composition WORKS for the photo. 8!Subject: Funky subjects who look like hippies are cool. 10.Technical: 8. Sharpness''s fine, colors rule, contrast rocks, but shadows poop.Improvement: Fill-in flash and flying ninjas.Summary: Since you''re last on the list, you''re my last "critiquee". Thanks for capping off my critiquing session with fun. I''m a number too short on screws in the head so please do not be offended.;p  ', '2006-05-09 03:37:48.000000', NULL, 0),
