(2397535, 327021, 30454, '<td valign="top">Greetings from your own critique club. As always, the comments are based on my personal opinion about the picture.<br/> <br/><b>First Impression:</b> <br/>Very Nice Silhouette shot. <br/><b>Composition: </b> <br/>Good composition. The picture is tilted. I don''t know if that was on purpose. I would have rotated the photo.<br/><b>Subject: </b> <br/>I really like the subject, Silhouette effect. But I don''t know if it fits the challenge. <br/><b>Technical (Colour and light): </b> <br/>The lighting is good. The sky color is different, don''t know if it''s processed. I would have liked orange/yellow evening color beter in the BG. <br/><b>Improvement: </b> <br/>Rotate the picture, different BG color. <br/><b>Summary: </b> <br/>Nice picture over all. Rotate the picture, and see if you can do the different color balance.<br/> <br/>Edit to add:<br/> <br/>The horizon is fine, it''s not tilted. Looking at the first site it looked like that, but it''s not. My bad.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-09 18:30:55.</i></td>', 'Greetings from your own critique club. As always, the comments are based on my personal opinion about the picture. First Impression: Very Nice Silhouette shot. Composition:  Good composition. The picture is tilted. I don''t know if that was on purpose. I would have rotated the photo.Subject:  I really like the subject, Silhouette effect. But I don''t know if it fits the challenge. Technical (Colour and light):  The lighting is good. The sky color is different, don''t know if it''s processed. I would have liked orange/yellow evening color beter in the BG. Improvement:  Rotate the picture, different BG color. Summary:  Nice picture over all. Rotate the picture, and see if you can do the different color balance. Edit to add: The horizon is fine, it''s not tilted. Looking at the first site it looked like that, but it''s not. My bad.', '2006-05-09 16:24:24.000000', '2006-05-09 19:30:55.000000', 0),
(2397590, 327996, 40465, '<td valign="top">Hi! Thanks so much for telling me about the crituqe threas:)<br/> <br/>Ok, down to business...<br/> <br/>The fence in the backround is a bit distracting.<br/>It is slightly ou of focus (most of my pics are)<br/>Maybe sharpening could help a bit<br/> <br/>The action shot is good:) Your timing was great:)<br/>The best of luck for the rest of your challenges</td>', 'Hi! Thanks so much for telling me about the crituqe threas:) Ok, down to business... The fence in the backround is a bit distracting.It is slightly ou of focus (most of my pics are)Maybe sharpening could help a bit The action shot is good:) Your timing was great:)The best of luck for the rest of your challenges', '2006-05-09 16:45:05.000000', NULL, 0),
