(2413413, 327996, 30454, '<td valign="top">Greetings from your own critique club.<br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b> <br/>Nice sport action shot. <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>Composition is okay. Don''t like the people in the background though. The tilted net also bothers me.<br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>I really like the subject. Fits the challenge well.<br/>Technical (Colour and light): <br/>The colors are perfect. Lighting on the middel girl is bit harse. <br/><b>Improvement:</b> <br/>I don''t really know if it was possible to crop the people in the back ground. The lighting it too bright on the middle and left side girl. Just wonderig if it would have looked better in B/W.<br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>NIce shot, meets the challenge. Well done.<br/> <br/>Cheers!!</td>', 'Greetings from your own critique club. First Impression Nice sport action shot. Composition: Composition is okay. Don''t like the people in the background though. The tilted net also bothers me.Subject: I really like the subject. Fits the challenge well.Technical (Colour and light): The colors are perfect. Lighting on the middel girl is bit harse. Improvement: I don''t really know if it was possible to crop the people in the back ground. The lighting it too bright on the middle and left side girl. Just wonderig if it would have looked better in B/W.Summary: NIce shot, meets the challenge. Well done. Cheers!!', '2006-05-14 01:38:25.000000', NULL, 0),
